    "description": "<p><strong>Maintenance Technicians - Why You Should Apply</strong></p><p><strong>Â£45,500:</strong> Shift allowance and a small amount of guaranteed overtime are already included in the figure.</p><p><strong>No Saturday Working:</strong> The three-shift rota leaves every Saturday free. Two Sundays in three are yours too, with the third starting at 10pm on your nights week.</p><p><strong>Backed to 2028:</strong> Order books are already secured to 2028 at this successful manufacturing plant in South Wales.</p><p><strong>Your Remuneration Package:</strong></p><ul><li>Â£45,500 (shift allowance and a small amount of guaranteed overtime included) base salary Â£43,893</li><li>25 days holiday plus bank holidays</li><li>4% matched pension and a healthcare cash plan</li><li>Days 6am to 2pm and afternoons 2pm to 10pm (Monday to Friday), nights 10pm to 6am (Sunday to Thursday)</li></ul><p><strong>What You'll Be Doing as a Multi-Skilled Maintenance Technician</strong></p><p><br> A genuine Multi-Skilled Maintenance Technician workload across reactive repairs, a planned maintenance programme and project work on equipment upgrades.</p><p><strong>What You'll Need To Apply:</strong></p><ul><li>A time-served apprenticeship</li><li>Capability across electrical and mechanical maintenance.</li><li>Manufacturing maintenance experience</li></ul><p><strong>Next Steps:</strong></p><p><br> Apply today or contact us for a conversation. Multi-Skilled Maintenance Technician interviews are being scheduled shortly</p><p>If you click '<strong>Apply</strong>', we may contact you via email, phone &amp; text message regarding this job, other jobs (current and future), and related recruitment services. You can OPT OUT at any time; full details are in our Privacy Policy at sigmarecruitment.co.uk/privacy-policy or find the policy in the Sigma website footer. Location and postcode of the advert are approximate. Don't include special category data or referee contact details in your application or CV. We use AI to triage applications, but a human makes the final decision.<br></p><p>LNKD1_UKTJ</p><br/><br/>Please mention the word **LIKED** and tag RMjYwNTo1OWMwOmUzZjo3MTA4OjU4M2Q6NDQ5Yzo4ZmE6MmJlMw== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwNTo1OWMwOmUzZjo3MTA4OjU4M2Q6NDQ5Yzo4ZmE6MmJlMw==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.",
