    "location": "Remote",
    "description": "<strong>Job Description<br><br></strong><strong> Detailer â Southtown Hyundai <br><br></strong>Some people clean cars.<br><br>Real detailers take pride in making a vehicle look better than the day it rolled off the lot.<br><br>Southtown Hyundai is hiring Detailers, and weâre looking for people who actually care about the finished product. The kind of person who notices the little things, works hard without being babysat, and takes satisfaction in seeing a vehicle completely transformed before it leaves the shop.<br><br><strong>This Is a Busy Operation With Serious Workflow<br><br></strong><ul><li> 200â230 new vehicles sold monthly </li><li> 80â100 used vehicles sold monthly </li><li> Approximately 130 service appointments per day <br><br></li></ul>That means steady work, constant vehicle flow, and no standing around waiting for something to do<br><br>If you like staying active, working around vehicles all day, and being part of a shop culture where effort actually matters, this is worth checking out.<br><br>Qualified candidates may receive an offer on the spot.<br><br>Free Go Auto swag for interview attendees.<br><br>You do NOT need to be a master detailer already. If you have a strong work ethic, take pride in your work, and want to learn, weâll teach you.<br><br><strong>What Weâre Looking For<br><br></strong><ul><li> Someone who works hard and moves with urgency </li><li> Strong attention to detail </li><li> Comfortable working in a fast-paced environment </li><li> Positive attitude and team-first mentality </li><li> Someone who takes pride in seeing a finished vehicle look incredible </li><li> Valid Class 5 driverâs license required <br><br></li></ul>Experience with polishing, paint protection, shampooing, and detailing is an asset, but attitude and work ethic matter just as much.<br><br><strong>What You Get<br><br></strong><ul><li> Stable, full-time work in a busy body shop </li><li> Training and development through Go Auto U </li><li> Health and dental benefits </li><li> Vacation starting at 3 weeks </li><li> Employee Investment Program with up to 16% annual return </li><li> Real advancement opportunities within Go Auto <br><br></li></ul>A lot of people inside Go Auto started in similar roles and built serious careers from there. Some of our General Managers and Vice Presidents started as detailers.<br><br>If youâre reliable, motivated, and want an opportunity where hard work actually gets noticed, come meet us.<br><br>Interview spots are already being booked.<br/><br/>Please mention the word **DISTINGUISHED** and tag RMjYwNTo1OWMwOmUzZjo3MTA4OjU4M2Q6NDQ5Yzo4ZmE6MmJlMw== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwNTo1OWMwOmUzZjo3MTA4OjU4M2Q6NDQ5Yzo4ZmE6MmJlMw==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.",
