    "company": "PVH Group Inc",
    "location": "Remote",
    "description": "<p>Are you a detail-driven payroll professional looking for your next opportunity? We're looking for a Payroll Clerk to join our team and support weekly and monthly payroll processing across a dynamic group of companies. This is a great chance to grow your payroll career within a fast-paced, professional environment. Experience with Paypak payroll software is considered a strong asset.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Key Requirements</strong>:</p><ul><li>Prior experience processing payroll, ideally within a multi-company environment</li><li>Ability to process weekly and monthly payrolls accurately and on time</li><li>Strong attention to detail and good organizational skills</li><li>Familiarity with statutory deductions and payroll compliance</li><li>Discretion in handling confidential and sensitive information</li></ul><p><br></p><p><strong>Asset</strong></p><ul><li>Experience working with Paypak payroll software</li></ul><p><br></p><p>If you're reliable, organized, and ready to grow your career with a professional team, we'd love to hear from you!</p><p><br></p><p>Apply now! All suitably qualified applicants interested in this opportunity, please email your cover letter along with a detailed curriculum vitae to</p><p><br></p><p>https://pvhgroupinc.bamboohr.com/careers/163?source=aWQ9MjI%3D &nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p>Applications should reach the company no later than <strong>September 15, 2026</strong>.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><br/><br/>Please mention the word **EXHILARATION** and tag RMjYwNTo1OWMwOmUzZjo3MTA4OjU4M2Q6NDQ5Yzo4ZmE6MmJlMw== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwNTo1OWMwOmUzZjo3MTA4OjU4M2Q6NDQ5Yzo4ZmE6MmJlMw==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.",
