    "location": "Remote",
    "description": "<ul><li>At Delta Hotels by Marriott, we like to keep things simple and get them done right. Weâre a busy, friendly team, and weâre looking for a handy, reliable Maintenance Team Member to help us keep the hotel looking sharp and running smoothly.<br><br></li></ul>We are looking for a highly motivated person with real \"can do\" attitude. If you're someone who loves solving problems, stays positive when things get busy, and takes pride in a job well done, we want to hear from you!<br><br><strong>What Youâll Be Doing<br><br></strong><ul><li>Assist with planned preventive maintenance (PPM): General repairs like painting, changing silicone, or basic plumbing and electrical jobs.</li><li>Keeping rooms in perfect conditions: Doing regular walk-throughs to catch little issues (like a loose door handle or a burnt out lightbulb) before a guest does.</li><li>Helping our guests: Heading up to guest rooms to fix any quick issues with a smile and a \"no problem\" attitude.</li><li>Working as a team: Supporting the Maintenance Manager and helping other departments .</li><li>Staying safe: Following the usual health and safety rules to keep yourself, the team, and our guests safe.</li><li>Sorting the workshop: Keeping your tools tidy and letting us know when weâre running low on supplies.<br><br></li></ul><strong>What We Expect<br><br></strong><ul><li>A flexible approach to working hours (including one weekend a month)</li><li>Previous experience in maintenance or handyman role is preferred</li><li>An electrical or plumbing qualification is a bonus but not required</li><li>Attention to details and practical problem solving<br><br></li></ul>What is in it for you: In addition to receiving a competitive salary and investment in your personal development, you will have access to an array of perks and discounts including:<br><br><ul><li>Free Meals on Duty: Enjoy complimentary meals while at work.</li><li>Call out Surcharge: A supplementary payment while on call for the hotel </li><li>Uniform Provided: A professional uniform is supplied for all employees.</li><li>Explore Discounts: A Marriott Discount Card that offers benefits on hotel stays and F&amp;B across 140 countries.</li><li>Pension Scheme: Participation in The Peopleâs Pension.</li><li>Employee Assistance Programme: Free and confidential support for various challenges, including financial advice, stress, and health issues.</li><li>Career Development: Opportunities for career growth and internal transfers within Marriott's global network.</li><li>Training and Development: Access to training programs to enhance your skills and advance your career.<br><br></li></ul><em>Note:</em><em> This above description is not intended to establish a total definition of the job, but an outline of the duties. <br><br></em>Join us and be part of a team that values excellence, sustainability, and career growth. Apply today to start your journey with Marriott!<br/><br/>Please mention the word **FRIENDLY** and tag RMjYwNTo1OWMwOmUzZjo3MTA4OjU4M2Q6NDQ5Yzo4ZmE6MmJlMw== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwNTo1OWMwOmUzZjo3MTA4OjU4M2Q6NDQ5Yzo4ZmE6MmJlMw==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.",
