    "id": "remoteok-1137237",
    "source": "RemoteOK",
    "title": "Kitchen Porter W Edinburgh",
    "company": "W Hotels",
    "location": "Remote",
    "description": "<strong>Additional Information<br><br></strong><strong>Job Number</strong> 26109811<br><br><strong>Job Category</strong> Food and Beverage &amp; Culinary<br><br><strong>Location</strong> 1 St James Square, Edinburgh, Scotland, United Kingdom, EH1 3AXVIEW ON MAP<br><br><strong>Schedule</strong> Full Time<br><br><strong>Located Remotely?</strong> N<br><br><strong>Position Type</strong>  Non-Management<br><br><strong>Pay Range:</strong> Â£12.71ph<br><br><strong>W Edinburgh is hiring a Kitchen Porter to join our team! We invite you to play an integral part in bringing to life this unique brand with Edinburgh!<br><br></strong><strong>Explore an exciting new career path at W Hotels where your natural talent is celebrated. W Hotelâs work culture is uniquely designed to spark your imagination and curiosity while bringing the W experience to life for guests.<br><br></strong><strong>About w Hotels<br><br></strong>Ignite Curiosity, Expand Worlds. W Hotels are a place to experience life. Weâre here to open doors and open minds. With us, thereâs always more. We dare to deliver a different kind of luxury. One that revels in bold ideas and indulges in the unexpected. We believe luxury is the freedom to be yourself and explore desires: whatever, whenever.<br><br><strong>About w Edinburgh Kitchen<br><br></strong>W Edinburgh brings exciting new culinary destinations to the capital of Scotland. Situated on the 10th and 11th floors of the hotel, the spaces offer unrivalled panoramic view across the city, making it one of the most beautiful places in Edinburgh to dine.<br><br>Our signature restaurant is a partnership with SUSHISAMBA, which celebrates the culture and cuisine of Japan, Brazil and Peru. The menus are a mix of new and signature dishes with an emphasis on bold flavours, the finest ingredients and artful presentations.<br><br>W Lounge is W Edinburghâs social hub for guests and locals alike. Open from 9am until late, W Lounge will showcase the best of Gaelic produce in its food offering, complimented with innovative beverage concepts.<br><br>Furthermore, there is innovative Breakfast, Room Service and Event menus. Supporting all aspects of the kitchen operation will give you the opportunity to find where your passion truly lies.<br><br><strong>About The Role<br><br></strong>Joining the team means you will be instrumental to the success of the hotel and the restaurantâs operation and beyond. We are looking for someone who is passionate about hospitality, eager to learn and committed to excellence!<br><br>As Kitchen Porter, key aspects of your role will include:<br><br><ul><li>Operate and maintain cleaning equipment and tools, including the dish washing machine, hand wash stations pot-scrubbing station, and trash compactor</li><li>Wash and disinfect kitchen and store room areas, tables, tools, knives, and equipment</li><li>Receive deliveries, store perishables properly, and rotate stock</li><li>Ensure clean wares are stored in appropriate areas</li><li>Inspect, pull, and stack cleaned items, send soiled items back for re-scrubbing and re-washing</li><li>Clean and mop all areas in assigned departments<br><br></li></ul>Our ideal Kitchen Porter is someone who has:<br><br><ul><li>Follow all company and safety and security policies and procedures</li><li>A warm, people-oriented demeanour</li><li>A team-first attitude</li><li>Protect company assets</li><li>Develop and maintain positive working relationships with others</li><li>Ensure adherence to quality expectations and standards<br><br></li></ul>In return for your hard work, we give you:<br><br><ul><li>World class training and development, including leadership development</li><li>Unlimited career opportunities (internationally and locally)</li><li>Wellness and mental health programmes</li><li>Discounted accommodation, food and beverage in over 9,000 hotels all over the world!</li><li>Discounts for your friends and family</li><li>Specially curated discounts in thousands of shops<br><br></li></ul><strong>About The Property<br><br></strong>W Edinburgh brings bold architecture and a vibrant lifestyle offering to the Scottish capital. Behind a faÃ§ade featuring a winding steel ribbon â reflecting the cityâs festival spirit â this 12-storey structure is the centerpiece of Edinburgh St James Quarter, incorporating retail, leisure and entertainment facilities along with residential apartments.<br><br>This W hotel helps redefine the cityâs hospitality landscape. Accordingly, it fuses the brandâs signature amenities with modern design and W Happenings, highlighting whatâs new in design, fashion, music and culture.<br><br>Built in 2023, this new W hotel accommodates guests across 244 stylish guestrooms, including 45 suites. While staying here, guests benefit from the brandâs signature Whatever / Whenever service philosophy.<br><br>A real highlight of this property is its rooftop bar and outdoor terrace, pairing exciting cocktails and cuisine with 360-degree views over the historic city. Among the other noteworthy amenities are the W Lounge, a restaurant collaboration with SUSHISAMBA, a FIT workout facility and an AWAY spa, with special functions hosted in 2,450 sq ft of modern event space.<br><br>If this sounds like the perfect place for you, apply to be a Kitchen Porter with us today!<br><br><em>At Marriott International, we are dedicated to being an equal opportunity employer, welcoming all and providing access to opportunity. We actively foster an environment where the unique backgrounds of our associates are valued and celebrated.â¯Our greatest strength lies in the rich blend of culture, talent, and experiences of our associates. We are committed to non-discrimination on any protected basis, including disability, veteran status, or other basis protected by applicable law.<br><br></em>W Hotelsâ mission is to Ignite Curiosity, Expand Worlds. We are a place to experience life. Weâre here to open doors and open minds. We are constantly inspired by new faces and new experiences. A tuned-in, up-for-anything spirit is at our core and has made us renowned for reinventing the norms of luxury around the globe. Whatever/Whenever is our culture and service philosophy that brings our guestsâ passions to life. If you are original, innovative, and always looking towards the future of whatâs possible, welcome to W Hotels. In joining W Hotels, you join a portfolio of brands with Marriott International. <strong>Be</strong>  where you can do your best work, <strong>begin</strong>  your purpose, <strong>belong</strong>  to an amazing global team, and <strong>become</strong>  the best version of you.<br/><br/>Please mention the word **ABUNDANCE** and tag RMjYwNTo1OWMwOmUzZjo3MTA4OjU4M2Q6NDQ5Yzo4ZmE6MmJlMw== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwNTo1OWMwOmUzZjo3MTA4OjU4M2Q6NDQ5Yzo4ZmE6MmJlMw==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.",
