    "id": "remoteok-1137218",
    "source": "RemoteOK",
    "title": "MOT Tester",
    "company": "Mr Clutch Autocentres",
    "location": "Remote",
    "description": "<p><span>We have a fabulous opportunity for an experienced MOT Tester to join our friendly team.</span></p><p><span>We offer a competitive salary with an outstanding bonus scheme, ongoing training and the opportunity to progress within the company for the right candidate.</span></p><p><span>Current employee quotes:</span></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><em><strong>\"Such a good bonus scheme, the BEST I have had from anywhere I have worked. It is more realistic here as it goes on your own productivity and not anyone else's\"</strong>. </em><span>Mr Clutch employee, employed over 6 years.</span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><em><span><strong>\"Most places you have to hit a centre bonus, but here you can hit a bonus no matter what, as long as you are productive, it is achieveable. I know I am going to get my bonus because of what I do, not anyone else!\"</strong></span></em><span>Mr Clutch employee, employed over 8 years.</span></p><p><span>Our MOT Tester positions are dedicated positions that play a crucial role within our branches. By carrying out MOT Testing to DVSA standards on a variety of vehicle types, our MOT Testers assist with meeting our customer needs and work closely with the staff team to provide an efficient workshop flow. If you hold a current DVSA card, enjoy working as part of a friendly team, and take pride in your work, please do submit your CV at your earliest opportunity.</span></p><p><span>Only MOT Testers with appropriate qualifications should apply. The ideal applicant will have experience and be skilled in all makes and models of cars. In return, we offer excellent earning potential with a good bonus scheme and working practices.</span></p><p><span>Purpose of Job</span></p><ul><li><span>You will berequired to conduct MOT's in line with DVSA guidelines and to adhere to company policies.</span></li><li><span>You will be required to ensure all MOT's are carried out in line with DVSA guidelines to ensure full compliance</span></li><li><span>You will be required to ensure all work is carried out observing safe working practices of self and others</span></li></ul><p><span>Salary: Negotiable</span></p><p><span>Hours: 48 per week (Mon to Fri 8.30am to 5.30pm &amp; 8.30-5 Sat)</span></p><p><span>Benefits:We are committed to the development and career progression of all personnel and offer exceptional in-house training, along with an excellent bonus system that rewards both productivity and efficiency.</span></p><ul><li><span>Potential for 44 days paid leave(including bank holidays)</span></li><li><span>Excellent bonus scheme</span></li><li><span>Development opportunities</span></li><li><span>Career progression</span></li><li><span>Training at our IMI approved Training Academies (Strood/Reading)</span></li><li><span>Uniform</span></li><li><span>Company discount</span></li><li><span>Pension scheme<br></span></li></ul><p>LNKD1_UKTJ</p><br/><br/>Please mention the word **CELEBRATED** and tag RMjYwNTo1OWMwOmUzZjo3MTA4OjU4M2Q6NDQ5Yzo4ZmE6MmJlMw== when applying to show you read the job post completely (#RMjYwNTo1OWMwOmUzZjo3MTA4OjU4M2Q6NDQ5Yzo4ZmE6MmJlMw==). This is a beta feature to avoid spam applicants. Companies can search these words to find applicants that read this and see they're human.",
