  {
    "id": "wwr-8fa08f2caf2d",
    "source": "We Work Remotely",
    "title": "Trafilea: Design Specialist",
    "company": "",
    "location": "Remote (Worldwide)",
    "description": "\n\n<p>\n  <strong>Headquarters:</strong> Remote, B, Argentina\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"sc-1gch2qa-0 fhKCjg\"><div><div class=\"sc-gfrfnr-2 deOrHQ\"></div><div class=\"sc-18h7are-0 ebVyJP\"><div class=\"sc-1tu9fip-2 ezRMeN\"><div class=\"sc-1tu9fip-1 kdUgoN\"><div class=\"sc-1tu9fip-3 iFQjUO\"><div class=\"sc-ji5wy4-0 jIYAZB\"><div><div><div><div><div class=\"sc-1uwf3m5-2 ipgOZn\"><div class=\"sc-1v95195-0 jscoSJ\"><div><div><h2 class=\"sc-1npqnwg-4 sc-1npqnwg-5 sc-1uwf3m5-0 gODXpB custom-css-style-job-description\">Job description</h2><div class=\"sc-1fwbcuw-0 eBBsFD\"><div><h4><strong>About Trafilea</strong></h4><p>Trafilea is a Consumer Tech Platform for Transformative Brand Growth. We’re building the AI Growth Engine that powers the next generation of consumer brands.</p><p>With over $1B+ in cumulative revenue, 12M+ customers, and 500+ talents across 19 countries, we combine technology, growth marketing, and operational excellence to scale purpose-driven, digitally native brands.</p><p>We own and operate our own digitally native brands (not an agency), with presence in Walmart, Nordstrom, and Amazon, and a strong global D2C footprint.</p><p></p><h4><strong>Why Trafilea</strong></h4><p>We’re a tech-led eCommerce group scaling our own globally loved DTC brands, while helping ambitious talent grow just as fast.</p><p> We build and scale our own brands.</p><p> We invest in AI and automation like few others in eCom.</p><p> We test fast, grow fast, and help you do the same.</p><p> Be part of a dynamic, diverse, and talented global team.</p><p> 100% Remote, USD competitive salary, paid time off, and more.</p><p></p><h4><strong>Job Responsibilities</strong></h4><p>At Trafilea, design is not decoration—it’s performance.</p><p>You’ll elevate the brand, ensure consistency across every channel, and push creative boundaries by leveraging AI—while building scalable frameworks and optimizing creative processes to reach millions of customers worldwide.</p><p>This is where design meets data, AI, and scale.</p><p></p><ul><li><p>Create high-performing visual assets for marketing campaigns and digital platforms</p></li><li><p>Design with performance in mind: iterate based on data, not opinions</p></li><li><p>Produce multiple creative variations to support testing and optimization</p></li><li><p>Use AI tools to accelerate ideation, production, and iteration</p></li><li><p>Collaborate with marketing, performance, and product teams</p></li><li><p>Maintain strong brand consistency across all touchpoints</p></li><li><p>Improve workflows using AI and automation</p></li></ul></div></div><h2 class=\"sc-1npqnwg-4 sc-1npqnwg-5 sc-1uwf3m5-0 sc-1uwf3m5-1 fySqGw custom-css-style-job-requirements\">Job requirements</h2><div class=\"sc-1fwbcuw-0 eBBsFD\"><div><ul><li><p>8+ years as a Senior Designer or Design Specialist (flexible for top talent)</p></li><li><p>Experience in fast-paced, high-performance environments</p></li><li><p>Strong portfolio in digital marketing and campaign design</p></li><li><p>Advanced skills in Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign, and Figma</p></li><li><p>Comfortable working with AI tools (ChatGPT, Krea, Midjourney, etc.)</p></li><li><p>Strong visual judgment and attention to detail</p></li><li><p>Able to manage multiple projects under tight deadlines</p></li><li><p>Fluent in English</p></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"sc-1uwf3m5-4 fKDjfR\"><div class=\"sc-e5uvhz-0 kHqIkC\"><div class=\"sc-e5uvhz-8 ekemGm\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div></div><div><div><div class=\"sc-1f8x0pm-0 ibrjJt\"><div><h3 class=\"sc-1npqnwg-4 sc-1npqnwg-5 sc-1f8x0pm-1 gLJdHv\">All done!</h3><p class=\"sc-1npqnwg-9 sc-1npqnwg-10 eQNOpr\">Your application has been successfully submitted!</p></div><div class=\"sc-1f8x0pm-2 dvyFlr\"><a class=\"sc-s03za1-0 fPoupN custom-css-style-application-success-button\" href=\"/\">Other jobs</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n\n<p><strong>To apply:</strong> <a href=\"https://weworkremotely.com/remote-jobs/trafilea-design-specialist\">https://weworkremotely.com/remote-jobs/trafilea-design-specialist</a></p>\n",
