  {
    "id": "wwr-878ef26099fb",
    "source": "We Work Remotely",
    "title": "Bee Talents: Platform Product Analyst (PLG & Mixpanel Expert) | Gcore | Remote",
    "company": "",
    "location": "Remote (Worldwide)",
    "description": "\n\n<p>\n  <strong>Headquarters:</strong> Remote but only within Poland\n</p>\n\n<div class=\"content\"><div class=\"section-wrapper page-full-width\"><div class=\"section page-centered\"><div><b>Who are we?</b></div><div><br></div><div>We're Bee Talents, an IT recruitment agency that has been helping clients from all around the world in building their technical teams since 2015. Currently we have a great pleasure of working as an exclusive RPO provider for <b>Gcore </b>and we would like to invite you to participate in the recruitment process for<b> Platform Product Analyst (PLG &amp; Mixpanel Expert).</b></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><b>Company Description</b></div><div><br></div><div><b><i>This position is available only under an employment (labor) agreement.&nbsp;</i></b></div><div><br></div><div>The world’s digital experiences run on something invisible: the infrastructure and software that keep them fast, reliable, and secure. At Gcore, <b>you’ll help design and deliver that foundation for an AI-driven world.&nbsp;</b></div><div>We’re a global provider of infrastructure and software solutions for <b>AI, cloud, network, and security,</b> powering everything from real-time communication and streaming to enterprise AI and secure web applications. With <b>210+ edge locations, 50+ cloud regions, and thousands of GPUs,</b> your work here can reach users and businesses across the globe.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>You’ll collaborate with leading technology partners such as <b>Intel, NVIDIA, Dell, and Equinix,</b> and work on platforms that power digital products used around the world. Our vision is simple: to connect the world to AI, anywhere, anytime.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div><b>Want to work on technology that goes beyond a single product or industry?</b>&nbsp; Join a global team of <b>550+ professionals</b> building infrastructure and software that supports the entire digital ecosystem.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div><b>We are currently looking for a Platform Product Analyst (PLG &amp; Mixpanel Expert)</b>,&nbsp;a Data-Driven Growth Partner for our Platform team. Your focus is our Self-Service funnel. We have a powerful cloud platform where users can register, pay, and launch infrastructure on their own. Your job is to analyze their journey in Mixpanel, find friction points, and help us increase Activation and Revenue.</div><div><br></div><div><b>Job description</b></div></div><div class=\"section page-centered\"><div><h3>You will work in a cross-functional setup:</h3><ul class=\"posting-requirements plain-list\"><ul><li>Daily collaboration: You will work side-by-side with our Digital Director, as well as Backend and Frontend Developers, Product Managers and the UX/Design team, helping them prioritize features based on data.</li><li>Reporting: You will be structurally part of our BI (Business Intelligence) team, ensuring you have professional support and access to our data infrastructure. However, you will be embedded in the Platform team, working directly with the Digital Director on a daily basis.</li></ul></ul></div></div><div class=\"section page-centered\"><div><h3>What You'll Do:</h3><ul class=\"posting-requirements plain-list\"><ul><li>Self-Service Optimization: Deep dive into the registration → activation → payment flow. Identify where users drop off and propose A/B tests to fix it.</li><li>Product Qualified Leads (PQL): Analyze usage patterns to identify high-potential customers (e.g., \"This startup just spun up 50 GPUs\") and signal our Sales team to engage them.</li><li>Event Tracking Design: You are the owner of our tracking plan. You tell developers exactly which events and properties to track. \"If we don't track the 'Error 500' on the billing page, we are flying blind.\"</li><li>Dashboarding: Create clear, actionable dashboards in Mixpanel for Product Managers and Execs.</li><li>Hypothesis Testing: Help PMs formulate and measure experiments. Did the new onboarding flow increase activation? You give the final verdict.</li></ul></ul></div></div><div class=\"section page-centered\"><div><h3>Who You Are:</h3><ul class=\"posting-requirements plain-list\"><ul><li>You are a Mixpanel Ninja. You don't just look at standard dashboards. You build complex cohorts, retention curves, and funnel steps to understand exactly what users are doing.</li><li>You are AI-Native. You use AI tools (Cursor, ChatGPT, Claude) to accelerate your analysis. Need a complex JQL query for Mixpanel? You prompt it. Need to summarize user feedback? You use an LLM.</li><li>You have a Growth Mindset. You care about business metrics (Revenue, Conversion, Retention), not just vanity metrics (Pageviews). You are constantly looking for \"Aha! moments\" that turn visitors into paying customers.</li></ul></ul></div></div><div class=\"section page-centered\"><div><h3>What We Are Looking For:</h3><ul class=\"posting-requirements plain-list\"><ul><li>Experience: 3+ years in Product Analytics, preferably in a SaaS / PLG (Product-Led Growth) company.</li><li>Tooling: Mastery of Mixpanel (or Amplitude/Heap).&nbsp;Implementation from the ground up. You know how to clean data and debug events.&nbsp;</li><li>AI Workflow: Active user of AI tools for data analysis and automation.</li><li>Basic Technical Literacy: You can read a JSON event payload and understand SQL logic (even if you don't write complex ETLs).</li><li>English: Professional proficiency (C1/C2).</li></ul></ul></div></div><div class=\"section page-centered\"><div><h3>Nice to Have:</h3><ul class=\"posting-requirements plain-list\"><ul><li>Experience with B2B Cloud/Infrastructure products.</li><li>Understanding of Product-Led Sales (PLS) mechanics.</li><li>Experience with A/B testing tools.</li></ul></ul></div></div><div class=\"section page-centered\"><div><h3>Why Gcore?</h3><ul class=\"posting-requirements plain-list\"><ul><li>You will have a direct impact on our Self-Service revenue.</li><li>You will work with a modern stack (Mixpanel + AI tools) without legacy baggage.</li><li>We value data over opinion. If your analysis shows we are wrong, we change course.</li></ul></ul></div></div><div class=\"section page-centered\"><div><h3>Equal Opportunity Employer</h3><ul class=\"posting-requirements plain-list\"><ul><li>We provide equal opportunity to all applicants without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, age, gender identity, gender expression, national origin, disability, or any other legally protected characteristics.&nbsp;</li></ul></ul></div></div><div class=\"section page-centered\"><div><b>Additional Information</b></div><div><br></div><div><b>Benefits</b></div><div><br></div><div>At Gcore, we want you to do your best work and enjoy the journey. Our benefits are designed to support your growth, well-being, and life beyond work:&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>- Competitive compensation&nbsp;</div><div>- Flexible working hours and hybrid or remote options, depending on your role&nbsp;</div><div>- Work from anywhere in the world for up to <b>45 days per year</b>&nbsp;</div><div>- Private medical insurance for you and your family*&nbsp;</div><div>- Extra paid vacation and sick leave days*&nbsp;</div><div>- Support for life’s important moments and celebrations&nbsp;</div><div>- Language courses to help you connect and grow&nbsp;</div><div>- Modern, welcoming offices with snacks, drinks, and entertainment*&nbsp;</div><div>- Team sports and social activities*&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>*Benefits may vary depending on your location.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div><b>Equal Opportunity Employer</b></div><div><br></div><div>We provide equal opportunity to all applicants without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, age, gender identity, gender expression, national origin, disability, or any other legally protected characteristics.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div><b>BEE TALENTS INFORMATION CLAUSE ⬇️</b></div><div><br></div><div><span>The Administrator of your personal data is Bee Talents PSA, ul. Garbary 35/12, 61-868 Poznan, NIP: 7792463296. The purposes of processing your personal data are: conducting the initial stage of recruitment, based on your consents, participation in future recruitment processes conducted for our clients, based on the consent, defense against potential claims of our Clients for whom we conduct recruitment, in particular regarding the non-compliance of the Candidate’s profile with the requirements specified by the Client – which is a legitimate interest of the Data Administrator pursuant to art. 6 section 1 pt. f) GDPR. Due to data processing you have the right to access your personal data, request a copy of it, retrificate it, delete or limit it and withdraw of consents at any time, make an objection to the processing of personal data and lodge a complaint to the President of the Personal Data Protection Office if it&nbsp; violate the GDPR rights. You can read the full content of the information clause here:&nbsp;</span><a class=\"postings-link\" href=\"https://beetalents.com/eng-gdpr\">https://beetalents.com/eng-gdpr</a><span>.</span></div></div></div></div>\n\n<p><strong>To apply:</strong> <a href=\"https://weworkremotely.com/remote-jobs/bee-talents-platform-product-analyst-plg-mixpanel-expert-gcore-remote\">https://weworkremotely.com/remote-jobs/bee-talents-platform-product-analyst-plg-mixpanel-expert-gcore-remote</a></p>\n",
