  {
    "id": "himalayas-5c53dc58e9cc",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "WordPress Developer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "Qatar",
    "description": "<p>We are looking for an experienced WordPress Developer to join our team. As a WordPress Developer, you will be responsible for creating and maintaining WordPress websites, themes, and plugins. Your expertise in WordPress development will help us deliver high-quality, user-friendly websites to our clients.</p><h3>Responsibilities:</h3><ul>\n<li>Collaborate with clients and internal teams to understand project requirements and objectives.</li>\n<li>Develop custom WordPress themes and plugins to meet project specifications.</li>\n<li>Modify existing WordPress themes and plugins to enhance functionality and design.</li>\n<li>Ensure responsive and cross-browser compatibility for all WordPress projects.</li>\n<li>Troubleshoot and resolve issues related to website performance, security, and functionality.</li>\n<li>Stay up to date with the latest WordPress trends, themes, and plugins.</li>\n<li>Conduct regular updates, maintenance, and backups for WordPress websites.</li>\n<li>Integrate third-party APIs and services as needed.</li>\n<li>Provide technical support for clients and end-users when necessary.</li>\n<li>Collaborate with designers to ensure the seamless implementation of design concepts.</li>\n</ul><ul>\n<li>3+ years of professional experience in WordPress development.</li>\n<li>Proficiency in PHP, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.</li>\n<li>Strong knowledge of WordPress core, themes, and plugins.</li>\n<li>Experience with custom theme and plugin development.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with version control systems (e.g., Git).</li>\n<li>Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail.</li>\n<li>Excellent communication skills and a collaborative mindset.</li>\n<li>Ability to work with a variety of project management and development tools.</li>\n</ul><p>Kindly note that this job is fully remotely. and it is going to start as short term contract (4 months) and can be extended later</p><h3>TecFather Technologies</h3><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
