  {
    "id": "himalayas-3d23b2a30464",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "WordPress Developer + Creative Designer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "India",
    "description": "<div>\n<b>Contractor – WordPress Development, Wireframing &amp;Creative Design</b><br>\n</div><div>\n<b>Location:</b> Remote / Pune (preferred)<br>\n</div><div>\n<b>Experience:</b> 3–5 years<br>\n</div><div>\n<b>Engagement Type:</b> Contract (6 months)<br>\n</div><div>\n<hr>\n<br>\n</div><h3>The Role:</h3><p>We are seeking a dynamic and detail-oriented contractor witha hybrid skill set in WordPress development, wireframing, and creative design.This individual will be responsible for managing and updating our website,improving UX/UI flows, creating visual content, and supporting ongoingmarketing and campaign needs.</p><p>Reporting to the Digital Marketing Lead, the contractor willcollaborate with Marketing, and Content teams to build engaging digitalexperiences that drive brand visibility, user engagement, and lead generation.</p><p>The ideal candidate is equally comfortable building webpages, designing creative assets, and working in a fast-paced B2B marketingenvironment.</p><div>\n<hr>\n<br>\n</div><h3>Skills Requirements:</h3><ul>\n<li>Proven expertise in <b>WordPress development</b>, including custom themes, plugins, and performance optimization<br>\n</li>\n<li>Ability to create <b>translate wireframes</b> into responsive, functional, and visually engaging web pages using tools like Miro, Figma, Adobe XD, etc<br>\n</li>\n<li>Knowledge of <b>HTML, CSS, JavaScript</b> (basic to intermediate)<br>\n</li>\n<li>Perform ongoing <b>website maintenance</b>, including SEO updates, technical SEO improvements, and resolving bugs or broken links to ensure optimal performance and discoverability.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Proficiency in <b>Adobe Creative Suite</b> (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign) or similar design tools for creative designing<br>\n</li>\n<li>Ability to manage <b>multiple web and design requests</b> in parallel, with quick turnaround<br>\n</li>\n<li>Comfortable working in cross-functional teams and taking ownership of deliverables<br>\n</li>\n</ul><div>\n<hr>\n<br>\n</div><h3>Key Responsibilities:</h3><ul>\n<li>Maintain and update the company’s <b>WordPress website</b>, ensuring optimal performance, responsiveness, and SEO compatibility<br>\n</li>\n<li>Create and execute <b>wireframes and prototypes</b> for new pages, microsites, and campaign-specific landing pages<br>\n</li>\n<li>Design <b>creative assets</b> for digital marketing including banners, social media posts, emailers, and infographics<br>\n</li>\n<li>Collaborate with content and marketing teams to <b>translate briefs</b> into visually engaging, conversion-oriented designs<br>\n</li>\n<li>Optimize visual and code elements to enhance <b>page load speed and mobile responsiveness</b><br>\n</li>\n<li>Support ongoing <b>campaign and event design needs</b>, including webpage creation, collateral design, and brand assets<br>\n</li>\n<li>Ensure <b>design consistency</b> and brand alignment across all digital materials<br>\n</li>\n<li>Participate in weekly check-ins and align work with content, design, and campaign calendars<br>\n</li>\n<li>Stay up to date on <b>design trends, WordPress updates</b>, and user experience best practices<br>\n</li>\n</ul><div>\n<hr>\n<br>\n</div><h3>Required Skills &amp; Experience:</h3><ul>\n<li>3–5 years of relevant experience in <b>WordPress development and creative design</b> (agency or B2B brand experience preferred)<br>\n</li>\n<li>Bachelor’s degree in Web Design, Computer Science, Visual Communication, or related field<br>\n</li>\n<li>Demonstrated portfolio of <b>website and design projects</b><br>\n</li>\n<li>Experience working with <b>marketing and sales teams</b> to support demand generation<br>\n</li>\n<li>Strong problem-solving skills, a collaborative mindset, and the ability to work independently on tight deadlines<br>\n</li>\n</ul><br><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
