    "location": "Australia, Canada, France, Germany, India, Italy, Netherlands, Spain, United Kingdom, United States",
    "description": "<h3>Company Overview</h3><p>At Beyond Labs, we are a leading provider of on-demand, dedicated product teams for startups and enterprise clients. Our focus is on delivering innovative and scalable tech solutions, driven by a talented team of developers, designers, and project managers. Join us in creating impactful digital products that push boundaries.</p><h3>Job Title</h3><h3>WordPress Developer</h3><h3>Location</h3><h3>International (Remote)</h3><h3>Experience</h3><h3>3-5 years</h3><h3>Role Type</h3><h3>Entry to Mid-Level</h3><h3>Responsibilities</h3><ul>\n<li><p>Build and customize WordPress websites using Elementor and custom coding practices.</p></li>\n<li><p>Develop and maintain custom themes, plugins, and integrations as per client requirements.</p></li>\n<li><p>Ensure websites are responsive, SEO-friendly, and optimized for performance.</p></li>\n<li><p>Troubleshoot and resolve technical issues related to WordPress websites.</p></li>\n<li><p>Collaborate with designers and project managers to deliver high-quality, user-focused solutions.</p></li>\n<li><p>Stay updated with the latest WordPress trends, technologies, and best practices.</p></li>\n</ul><h3>What We’re Looking For</h3><ul>\n<li><p>Minimum of 4 years of professional WordPress development experience.</p></li>\n<li><p>Proficiency in Elementor and other page builders.</p></li>\n<li><p>Strong expertise in PHP, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and MySQL.</p></li>\n<li><p>Experience with creating and customizing themes and plugins.</p></li>\n<li><p>Understanding of REST APIs and third-party integrations.</p></li>\n<li><p>Knowledge of SEO, website optimization, and cross-browser compatibility.</p></li>\n<li><p>Excellent problem-solving skills and attention to detail.</p></li>\n<li><p>Ability to work independently and manage multiple projects.</p></li>\n</ul><h3>Bonus Skills</h3><ul>\n<li><p>Familiarity with Git and version control systems.</p></li>\n<li><p>Experience with WooCommerce and e-commerce website development.</p></li>\n<li><p>Understanding of advanced performance optimization techniques.</p></li>\n</ul><h3>Why Join Beyond Labs?</h3><ul>\n<li><p>Work with a passionate and talented team on exciting projects.</p></li>\n<li><h3>Flexible remote work environment.</h3></li>\n<li><p>Opportunities for professional growth and learning.</p></li>\n</ul><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
