    "location": "Switzerland",
    "description": "<p>Please do not apply if you are only Germany speaking PM and not a Frontend Developer ! Thanks.</p><h3>Aufgaben</h3><ul>\n<li>WordPress Frontend Design</li>\n<li>Customizing Templates</li>\n<li>Developing WordPress Sites</li>\n<li>Setting Up WooCommerce Products and Variants</li>\n<li>Modifying Design, Templates, Add-ons</li>\n<li>Updating Content and Images via FTP (WordPress, Typo3, E-commerce Shops)</li>\n<li>Editing HTML/CSS Templates</li>\n<li>Seeking Long-term Partnership</li>\n<li>Remote Work Only</li>\n<li>Direct Communication with Developers and Clients</li>\n<li>Installing/Modifying HTML Templates</li>\n<li>Creating Responsive and Valid HTML</li>\n<li>Availability During Business Hours</li>\n<li>Developing Extensions</li>\n<li>Specializing in Wordpress and WooCommerce</li>\n</ul><h3>Qualifikation</h3><h3>mandatory:</h3><ul>\n<li>German speaking / German reading</li>\n<li>contacts directly customer by email or phone/s kype (german language)</li>\n<li>paid by hours on project basis</li>\n<li>at least 3 year experience wordpress / frontend</li>\n</ul><h3>Benefits</h3><h3>- Full Remote</h3><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
