  {
    "id": "himalayas-5c1f1b48cb2c",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "WordPress Front-End Developer / Engineer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "United States",
    "description": "<p>If you love taking award-winning PSDs and creating super tight code and WordPress themes, then we're the place for you. You'll have the following skills:</p><ul>\n<li>Passion for WordPress and open source technology</li>\n<li>HTML, CSS, JavaScript, React, Angular</li>\n<li>PHP WordPress theme/plugin development - must build custom themes from scratch</li>\n<li>Bootstraps or other CSS Frameworks / Resets</li>\n<li>Modernizr</li>\n<li>Responsive/Adaptive development</li>\n<li>Progressive Enhancement / Graceful Degradation</li>\n<li>HTML and CSS Specifications (W3C / WHATWG)</li>\n<li>UX / Usability</li>\n<li>Cross-Browser / Cross-Platform Development</li>\n<li>Website Speed / Performance</li>\n<li>Debugging Tools (Firebug, etc)</li>\n</ul><ul>\n<li>Will have live URLs of your work to reference</li>\n<li>Must be able to collaborate effectively</li>\n<li>Must be a proactive communicator</li>\n<li>Must be able to get to extreme detail</li>\n<li>Likely an excellent writer</li>\n</ul><p>Must have a passion for all things web, learning every day and working with the most creative, awesome team in St. Louis.</p><p>Will probably love Mtn. Dew, Red Bull or American Honey.</p><p>Offshore firms and recruiters DO NOT APPLY.</p><p>Leading web consulting firm, designated as a Code Poet, in St. Louis is seeking passionate WordPress Engineer to join our growing team. We offer a flexible work from anywhere environment.</p><p>We are looking for creative developers who want to learn on a daily basis, take pride in developing highly usable, intuitive WordPress sites and hope to change the world via technology.</p><h3>We hire people based upon the H's:</h3><ul>\n<li>Happy - a zest for life and desire to delight our clients</li>\n<li>Humble - no egos allowed. ever.</li>\n<li>Hungry - will want to change the world</li>\n<li>Honest - always do what you say you're gonna do</li>\n</ul><h3>NON-smokers only, please.</h3><h3>NO offshore firms or recruiters, please.</h3><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
