  {
    "id": "himalayas-e2ae0af589c8",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "Web Developer / WordPress Developer / Marketing Web Specialist",
    "company": "",
    "location": "United States",
    "description": "<h3>This is a remote position.</h3><div>\n<b>Position: Web Developer / WordPress Developer / Marketing Web Specialist</b><div>\n<b>Location:</b> Remote <br><b>Experience:</b>4–6 years <br><b>Department:</b> Marketing &amp; Technology</div>\n<div>\n<b>About <a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/perceptive-analytics\">Perceptive Analytics</a></b><div>\n<a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/perceptive-analytics\">Perceptive Analytics</a> is a <b>Data Analytics and BI consulting company</b> helping enterprises turn their data into actionable insights using <b>Power BI, Tableau, and Advanced Analytics</b>. We are a <b>Microsoft Partner</b>, working with Fortune 200 clients across industries such as Financial Services, Pharma, Insurance, and Consulting.<div>We’re looking for a <b>Web Developer (WordPress + Salesforce)</b> who can build, maintain, and optimize our digital presence — from <b>marketing web pages and landing pages to email templates and integrated lead forms.</b><div>\n<b>Key Responsibilities</b><ul>\n<li>Develop and manage <b>WordPress-based websites</b> with responsive, SEO-friendly pages.\n</li>\n<li>Create and optimize <b>landing pages</b> for campaigns (Google Ads, LinkedIn, ABM).\n</li>\n<li>Design and code <b>HTML email templates</b> compatible with <b>Salesforce / Pardot / HubSpot</b>.\n</li>\n<li>Build and integrate <b>lead forms and gated content pages</b> with Salesforce CRM.\n</li>\n<li>Ensure <b>GA4, GTM, and tracking codes</b> are properly implemented for analytics and campaign reporting.\n</li>\n<li>Collaborate with marketing and design teams to bring <b>Figma or Adobe XD mockups</b> to life.\n</li>\n<li>Maintain website security, speed, and plugin updates; troubleshoot issues proactively.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<b>Required Skills</b><ul>\n<li>3–5 years of hands-on experience in <b>WordPress development</b> (themes, plugins, customizations).\n</li>\n<li>Strong command of <b>HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, and PHP.</b>\n</li>\n<li>Experience with <b>Salesforce, Pardot, or HubSpot</b> form and data integrations.\n</li>\n<li>Understanding of <b>technical SEO, responsive design, and website performance optimization.</b>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<b>Good to Have</b><ul>\n<li>Familiarity with <b>Webflow or HubSpot CMS.</b>\n</li>\n<li>Basic understanding of <b>UX/UI design.</b>\n</li>\n<li>Experience with <b>API integrations</b>and automation workflows.\n</li>\n<li>Version control experience <b>(Git, Bitbucket).</b>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<b>Why Join Us</b><ul>\n<li>Collaborate with a cross-functional <b>marketing, analytics, and design team.</b>\n</li>\n<li>Take ownership of the <b>entire web and lead-generation ecosystem.</b>\n</li>\n<li>Work in a creative, growth-oriented, and flexible environment.\n</li>\n</ul>\n<br><h3>Requirements</h3>\n<div>\n<b>Required Skills</b><ul>\n<li>3–5 years of hands-on experience in <b>WordPress development</b> (themes, plugins, customizations).\n</li>\n<li>Strong command of <b>HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, and PHP.</b>\n</li>\n<li>Experience with <b>Salesforce, Pardot, or HubSpot</b> form and data integrations.\n</li>\n<li>Understanding of <b>technical SEO, responsive design, and website performance optimization.</b>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
    "tags": [],
    "salary": "",
