  {
    "id": "himalayas-9af3b37d4ad0",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "(PH) Web Developer (WordPress)",
    "company": "",
    "location": "United States",
    "description": "<h3>This is a remote position.</h3><div>\n<b>Location:</b> Remote<div>\n<b>Employment Type:</b> Full-Time / Part-Time (Flexible)<h3><b>About the Role</b></h3>\n<p>We are looking for a skilled <b>Web Developer</b> with strong WordPress experience to design, develop, maintain, and optimize websites. The ideal candidate has hands-on experience with website development, plugin integration, troubleshooting, and SEO implementation, ensuring websites are both visually appealing and high-performing.</p>\n<h3>\n<b>Key Responsibilities</b><ul>\n<li>Develop, customize, and maintain WordPress websites.</li>\n<li>Build responsive, user-friendly, and high-performing websites.</li>\n<li>Install, configure, and troubleshoot WordPress themes and plugins.</li>\n<li>Integrate third-party tools, APIs, and plugins into WordPress websites.</li>\n<li>Optimize website speed, security, and overall performance.</li>\n<li>Implement on-page SEO best practices to improve search engine rankings.</li>\n<li>Perform regular website updates, maintenance, backups, and bug fixes.</li>\n<li>Collaborate with designers and marketing teams to implement new website features.</li>\n<li>Ensure websites are compatible across different browsers and devices.</li>\n</ul>\n</h3>\n<h3>\n<b>Required Skills &amp; Experience</b><ul>\n<li><b>WordPress Development and Maintenance</b></li>\n<li><b>Website Maintenance, Plugin Updates, and Basic Troubleshooting</b></li>\n<li><b>SEO (Search Engine Optimization) Practices and Internal Linking</b></li>\n<li><b>WordPress Plugin Integration</b></li>\n<li><b>Experience integrating third-party tools and platforms with WordPress</b></li>\n<li>Strong understanding of responsive web design principles.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and PHP is an advantage.</li>\n<li>Experience with website performance optimization and security best practices.</li>\n<li>Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail.</li>\n</ul>\n</h3>\n<h3>\n<b>Preferred Qualifications</b><ul>\n<li>Experience with page builders such as Elementor, Divi, or Gutenberg.</li>\n<li>Basic knowledge of Google Analytics, Google Search Console, and SEO tools.</li>\n<li>Experience working remotely with cross-functional teams.</li>\n<li>Ability to manage multiple projects and meet deadlines.</li>\n</ul>\n</h3>\n<h3>\n<b>What We Offer</b><ul>\n<li>Competitive compensation.</li>\n<li>Flexible remote work environment.</li>\n<li>Opportunity to work on a variety of exciting web projects.</li>\n<li>Supportive team with opportunities for professional growth.</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n</h3>\n</div>\n</div><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
