    "location": "Australia, Bangladesh, Canada, India, Nigeria, Pakistan, Philippines, South Africa, United Kingdom, United States",
    "description": "<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Job Title: </strong>WordPress Developer</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Location:</strong> Remote</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Company:</strong> <a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/sdf-systems\">SDF Systems</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Employment Type:</strong> Contract</li>\n</ul><h3>About US:</h3><p><a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/sdf-systems\">SDF Systems</a> is a technology-driven company focused on delivering innovative digital solutions. We are looking for a talented WordPress Developer who is passionate about building modern, responsive, and high-performing websites. The ideal candidate should have strong technical skills, attention to detail, and experience developing custom WordPress solutions.</p><h3>Key Responsibilities</h3><ul>\n<li>Develop, maintain, and optimize WordPress websites.</li>\n<li>Build custom WordPress themes and plugins based on business requirements.</li>\n<li>Convert Figma, Adobe XD, or PSD designs into responsive WordPress websites.</li>\n<li>Customize existing themes while following WordPress coding standards.</li>\n<li>Ensure websites are mobile-friendly, SEO-friendly, secure, and optimized for speed.</li>\n<li>Integrate third-party APIs, CRMs, payment gateways, and marketing tools.</li>\n<li>Troubleshoot website issues, bugs, and performance problems.</li>\n<li>Implement website security best practices and perform regular updates.</li>\n<li>Optimize Core Web Vitals and improve overall website performance.</li>\n<li>Collaborate with designers, marketers, and project managers to deliver projects on time.</li>\n<li>Manage website backups, migrations, staging environments, and deployments.</li>\n<li>Maintain website documentation and version control.</li>\n</ul><h3>Required Qualifications</h3><ul>\n<li>3+ years of professional experience in WordPress development.</li>\n<li>Strong knowledge of PHP, MySQL, HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, and jQuery.</li>\n<li>Experience developing custom WordPress themes and plugins.</li>\n<li>Strong understanding of WordPress hooks, filters, REST API, and Gutenberg.</li>\n<li>Experience with Advanced Custom Fields (ACF), Custom Post Types (CPT), and custom taxonomies.</li>\n<li>Experience with Elementor, WPBakery, or other page builders.</li>\n<li>Knowledge of WooCommerce customization.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with Git version control.</li>\n<li>Experience with website performance optimization and caching.</li>\n<li>Understanding of website security and WordPress best practices.</li>\n<li>Strong debugging and problem-solving skills.</li>\n</ul><h3>Required Skills</h3><ul>\n<li>WordPress Development</li>\n<li>PHP</li>\n<li>MySQL</li>\n<li>HTML5</li>\n<li>CSS3</li>\n<li>JavaScript</li>\n<li>jQuery</li>\n<li>REST APIs</li>\n<li>WooCommerce</li>\n<li>Elementor</li>\n<li>ACF</li>\n<li>Git</li>\n<li>Responsive Web Design</li>\n<li>Website Performance Optimization</li>\n<li>Website Security</li>\n<li>SEO Fundamentals</li>\n</ul><h3>Soft Skills</h3><ul>\n<li>Excellent communication skills.</li>\n<li>Strong attention to detail.</li>\n<li>Ability to work independently.</li>\n<li>Good time management and prioritization.</li>\n<li>Team player with a proactive mindset.</li>\n<li>Ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously.</li>\n</ul><p><em>Applicants with strong portfolios demonstrating custom WordPress development, performance optimization, and clean coding practices will be given preference.</em></p><p>All your information will be kept confidential according to the guidelines.</p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
