  {
    "id": "himalayas-14dc12fb830a",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "WordPress Developer – Website Services",
    "company": "",
    "location": "Philippines",
    "description": "<h3><strong>The Opportunity</strong></h3><p>We are seeking an experienced part time WordPress Developer for 20 hours a week to support a growing marketing and advertising organization focused on delivering premium-quality website and digital solutions for its clients. This role plays an important part in website migration, development, and optimization projects while collaborating with an established web services team in a structured remote environment.</p><p>The ideal candidate is detail-oriented, technically strong in modern front-end development, and comfortable working independently while following established project workflows and timelines. This opportunity is well suited for professionals who enjoy building and maintaining responsive WordPress websites while contributing to high-quality client deliverables.</p><h3><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>Migrate existing WordPress websites into a multisite WordPress environment while maintaining content structure, SEO metadata, and user experience consistency</li>\n<li>Build and manage website pages using WordPress Gutenberg editor and predefined design patterns</li>\n<li>Troubleshoot and resolve front-end and back-end WordPress functionality issues</li>\n<li>Customize and test WordPress themes and plugins to ensure compatibility and performance</li>\n<li>Conduct quality assurance testing prior to website launches to verify design, functionality, and responsiveness</li>\n<li>Collaborate with internal team members on project execution and development timelines</li>\n<li>Use Git version control and project management workflows to manage development tasks effectively</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>Compensation</strong></h3><p>Competitive monthly compensation based on experience and role scope.</p><p>Monthly compensation ranges from ₱32,000 – ₱45,000, depending on experience and role scope. Final compensation is aligned with the candidate’s experience level.</p><h3><strong>Required Skills</strong></h3><h3><strong>Core Technical Skills Required</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>Strong proficiency in HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, React, SQL, Bootstrap, and Git</li>\n<li>Experience developing and maintaining WordPress websites, including troubleshooting themes and plugins</li>\n<li>Experience using Figma and Adobe Creative Suite tools including Photoshop and Illustrator</li>\n<li>Familiarity with WordPress Gutenberg editor and responsive website development</li>\n<li>Ability to conduct QA testing and identify technical issues independently</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>Professional Skills Required</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><p>Strong communication and problem-solving abilities</p></li>\n<li><p>High attention to detail with strong organizational skills</p></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>Candidate Fit</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>Professionals who are comfortable working independently while following structured workflows and timelines</li>\n<li>Candidates who thrive in detail-oriented website development environments</li>\n<li>Individuals who enjoy collaborating with internal teams to deliver high-quality digital projects</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>Professional Readiness</strong></h3><p>Candidates applying for this role should have a reliable home office setup, stable internet connection, and the ability to maintain consistent availability during the required working hours.</p><p>Successful candidates communicate proactively, meet deadlines, and take ownership of responsibilities while working remotely.</p><h3><strong>About Our Client</strong></h3><p>Our client is an established marketing and advertising organization specializing in premium-quality digital and website solutions for its clients. The company operates within a collaborative, team-oriented environment that values communication, innovation, and operational excellence while supporting long-term client success.</p><h3><strong>Application Process</strong></h3><p>If you meet the requirements outlined above and are interested in this opportunity, please complete our quick application form by uploading your resume and submitting a short 1-minute introduction video.</p><h3>In your video briefly share:</h3><ul>\n<li><h3>Your professional background</h3></li>\n<li><h3>The types of work you specialize in</h3></li>\n<li><h3>Why this opportunity interests you</h3></li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/intelus-agency\">Intelus Agency</a> will review applications and contact qualified candidates regarding next steps.</p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
    "tags": [],
    "salary": "",
