    "title": "Opening of Wordpress developer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "India",
    "description": "<p>e require WordPress developers with a minimum experience of 1+ year.</p><h3>Role &amp; Responsibilities</h3><ul>\n<li>Work on WordPress themes and plugin development project.</li>\n<li>Work on WordPress customization project according client’s requirements.</li>\n<li>Work includes coding, handling support-requests, WordPress unit testing via debugging code and project documentation.</li>\n<li>Explain and guide the flow of product/project to customers</li>\n<li>(optional) Attending and speaking at different WordCamps and other tech community events.</li>\n<br>\n</ul><h3>Requirements</h3><ul>\n<br><li>A motivated self-starter, self-learner with strong leadership skills</li>\n<li>Must have knowledge of WordPress functions and latest updates of WordPress</li>\n<li>Creative approach to solving problems and love to work for WordPress</li>\n<li>Working knowledge of CSS, JavaScript, Jquery and AJAX is must. Knowledge of different frameworks will be plus</li>\n<li>Must have knowledge of Shortcode integration and API integration</li>\n<li>Expertise with MySQL and DBMS Concept</li>\n<li>Good understanding of cross-platform and cross-browser issues</li>\n<li>Good Communication Skill candidate have high preference</li>\n<li>We require WordPress developers with a minimum experience of 1+ year. Also we require Sr. WordPress developers &amp; Team leader.</li>\n<br>\n</ul><h3>What should be included with the resume?</h3><ul>\n<br><li>Project links of work you’ve done with WordPress along with a description</li>\n<li>Why you would be perfect for this job?</li>\n<br>\n</ul><ul>\n<li>\n<b>Salary:</b> No bar for right candidate</li>\n<br><li>\n<b>Location:</b> Surat, India OR <b>Remote Location<br><br></b>\n</li>\n<li><b>Job Type: Full-time<br></b></li>\n<br>\n</ul><p>Graduate (BCA, B.E./B.Tech. in Computer or I.T.), MCA, Diploma in Computer or I.T.</p><p>We are committed to cultivating a shared risk / mutual commitment relationship that supports the growth and success of both our clients and employees through our honesty, integrity, and respect for the individual.All your information will be kept confidential according to EEO guidelines.</p><p><a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/solwin-infotech\">Solwin Infotech</a> is one of the top IT service provider &amp; product development firm offering excellent solutions to the clients since its inception. We are expanding our team of brilliant brains.</p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
