    "description": "We are looking for a skilled WordPress Developer to turn Figma designs and other visual assets<br>into fully functional, high-performance WordPress websites. The ideal candidate has a deep<br>understanding of front-end and back-end development, follows modern best practices, and<br>ensures websites are fast, responsive, and SEO-optimized.<br><br>Responsibilities:<br>● Convert Figma or XD designs into responsive WordPress themes.<br>● Customize WordPress templates and plugins to meet design and functionality needs.<br>● Optimize website performance (Core Web Vitals, loading speed, SEO structure).<br>● Manage website maintenance, updates, and bug fixes.<br>● Collaborate with designers and SEO specialists to ensure site performance and UX<br>standards.<br>● (Nice to have) Experience with Shopify or other CMS platforms.<br><br>Qualifications:<br>● 3+ years of professional experience in WordPress development.<br>● Strong proficiency in PHP, HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript.<br>● Familiarity with Gutenberg, ACF, and major page builders (Elementor, WPBakery).<br>● Understanding of responsive design and cross-browser compatibility.<br>● Experience with SEO-friendly site structure and performance optimization.<br>● English proficiency (written and verbal)<p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
