  {
    "id": "himalayas-0d9c86de4cad",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "Senior PHP Developer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "United States",
    "description": "<h3>This is a remote position.</h3><p>Are you looking to be a part of an extraordinary Digital Transformation Company!</p><p>“We create sustainable solutions, as we take inspiration from the world around us and develop inventions”.</p><p>If you are an eager person for success, can see the invisible, will go the extra mile to deliver the best, then you are, who we are looking for and we are offering ‘‘<b>Senior PHP Developer</b>’’ role for you.</p><p>A brief job description of the position and preferred qualifications for the suitable candidates are defined below;</p><h3>Responsibilities :</h3><ul>\n<li>Design, develop and test end-to-end web, system applications using several different technologies,</li>\n<li>Collaborate within all levels of the organization to translate existing requirements into robust, scalable software applications,</li>\n<li>Be able to deliver on time and at the highest quality consistently,</li>\n<li>Create and maintain all kinds of user, application, and architecture documentation,</li>\n<li>Stay up to date on emerging technologies/industry trends.</li>\n</ul><br><h3>Requirements</h3><h3>Qualifications:</h3><ul>\n<li>Bachelor's Degree in Information Systems, Computer Engineering or equivalent technical degree,</li>\n<li>Fluent in written and spoken English,</li>\n<li>At least +4 years of Backend Development experience,</li>\n<li>Experienced in PHP framework structures (Symfony, Laravel, or similar frameworks),</li>\n<li>Experienced in ORMs (Doctrine, Eloquent or similar ORM).</li>\n</ul><br><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
