    "description": "<h3>Position: Sr. PHP Developer</h3><h3>Remote(Yes/No): Yes</h3><h3>Experience: 6+ yrs</h3><h3>Working shift timing: Normal</h3><h3>Job Description:</h3><p>Sr. PHP Developer Having expertise in <strong>Codeigniter, Laravel &amp; Rest API's.</strong></p><p><strong>Role Includes</strong> -</p><ul>\n<li>Developing Products for E-commerce Ecosystem.</li>\n<li>Develop, record, and maintain cutting-edge <strong>web-based PHP applications</strong>.</li>\n<li>Develop backend data services and contribute to increasing existing <strong>APIs.</strong>\n</li>\n</ul><h3>Requirements:</h3><ul>\n<li>Expertise in <strong>Codeigniter, Laravel, MySQL &amp; Rest APIs, and MongoDB.</strong>\n</li>\n<li>Proven experience as a PHP Developer with<strong> at least 6 years</strong> of hands-on development.</li>\n<li>Working experience in any <strong>CMS/e-commerce like Magneto, Open Cart, and WordPress.</strong>\n</li>\n<li>Required good knowledge of <strong>Ajax, jQuery</strong>\n</li>\n<li>Thorough in Object-oriented concepts.</li>\n<li>Knowledge of <strong>Amazon AWS Cloud services.</strong>\n</li>\n<li>Knowledge of<strong> Restful Web services.</strong>\n</li>\n<li>Knowledge of<strong> AngularJs or React is a big plus.</strong>\n</li>\n<li>Have worked on E-Commerce Application Development</li>\n</ul><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
