  {
    "id": "himalayas-c13d82c72817",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "SR. PHP DEVELOPER (LARAVEL OR SYMFONY)",
    "company": "",
    "location": "Remote",
    "description": "<h3>ABOUT REIZ TECH</h3><p>Reiz Tech is more than just an IT company. We are a trusted end-to-end IT advisor throughout clients’ business lifecycle. We have a growing global presence in more than 30 countries and regions, united to deliver end-to-end IT solutions. Our talents work together remotely, and low leadership levels are decentralized for better communication, decision-making, and flexibility. </p><h3>ABOUT THE ROLE</h3><p>Join our Development team to support the growth of our fintech product. As a <strong>Senior PHP Developer</strong>, you will play a key role in designing, building, and scaling high-performance backend systems. You will take ownership of complex technical solutions, contribute to architectural decisions, and ensure the delivery of secure, robust, and maintainable code aligned with fintech industry standards.</p><h3>RESPONSIBILITIES</h3><ul>\n<li><p>Design, develop, and maintain scalable backend systems using PHP (8.x) and modern frameworks (Laravel or Symfony).</p></li>\n<li><p>Architect robust, secure, and high-performing solutions aligned with fintech standards.</p></li>\n<li><p>Build and maintain REST APIs, ensuring proper versioning and backward compatibility.</p></li>\n<li><p>Optimize database performance (MySQL/MariaDB), including query tuning, schema design, and migrations.</p></li>\n<li><p>Implement and maintain CI/CD pipelines and containerized environments (Docker).</p></li>\n<li><p>Ensure code quality through testing strategies (unit, integration, feature tests) and code reviews.</p></li>\n<li><p>Apply SOLID principles, design patterns, and clean architecture in everyday development.</p></li>\n<li><p>Monitor application performance, identify bottlenecks, and implement optimizations.</p></li>\n<li><p>Enforce security best practices (OWASP, secure authentication flows, data protection, GDPR compliance).</p></li>\n<li><p>Collaborate with cross-functional teams to translate business requirements into technical solutions.</p></li>\n<li><p>Mentor junior and mid-level developers through code reviews and technical guidance.</p></li>\n<li><p>Contribute to technical decision-making, challenge requirements constructively, and promote best practices.</p></li>\n</ul><h3>REQUIREMENTS</h3><ul>\n<li><p>5+ years of professional experience in software development</p></li>\n<li><p>Expert-level knowledge of PHP 8.x and modern development practices</p></li>\n<li><p>5+ years of experience with Laravel or Symfony, including deep framework understanding</p></li>\n<li><p>Strong experience with MySQL or MariaDB (query optimization, schema design, normalization)</p></li>\n<li><p>Solid understanding of REST API design principles</p></li>\n<li><p>Proficiency with Git (branching strategies, code reviews, release workflows)</p></li>\n<li><p>Experience with PHPUnit and defining test strategies</p></li>\n<li><p>Hands-on experience with Docker and containerized production environments</p></li>\n<li><p>Strong knowledge of caching strategies and performance optimization</p></li>\n<li><p>Experience setting up and maintaining CI/CD pipelines (GitHub preferred)</p></li>\n<li><p>Solid understanding of Composer and dependency management</p></li>\n<li><p>Comfortable working in Linux/CLI environments</p></li>\n<li><p>Strong understanding of security best practices in web applications</p></li>\n</ul><p><strong>SOFT SKILLS</strong></p><ul>\n<li><p><strong>Ability to independently design and architect solutions</strong></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Strong problem-solving mindset with focus on maintainability and scalability</strong></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Confidence to challenge requirements and propose better alternatives</strong></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Ability to translate business needs into technical solutions</strong></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Experience leading initiatives or small teams</strong></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Strong written communication skills in async environments</strong></p></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>NICE TO HAVE</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><p><strong>Experience in fintech or financial services domain</strong></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Frontend development skills ( or React)</strong></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Experience with cloud platforms (Azure preferred)</strong></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Previous experience in technical interviewing or hiring</strong></p></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>WHAT WE OFFER</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><p><strong>Salary range: €5500 - €7000 (GROSS) / month.</strong></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Fully remote work with flexible work hours and vacation policy. </strong></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>A diverse international work environment that promotes inclusivity and collaboration. </strong></p></li>\n<li><h3><strong>Internal mentorship program. </strong></h3></li>\n<li><p><strong>Additional healthcare insurance, loyalty days. </strong></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Compensated professional development opportunities, including learning materials and certification exam fees. </strong></p></li>\n<li><h3><strong>Internal events and Learning Sessions. </strong></h3></li>\n<li><p><strong>Team-building compensation every quarter. </strong></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Participation in local events in Lithuania such as wakeboarding, excursions, and Meet and Eat gatherings. </strong></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Ability to change the project you’re working on. </strong></p></li>\n<li><h3><strong>Referral bonuses. </strong></h3></li>\n</ul><p class=\"Paragraph SCXW229886637 BCX8\"><strong>For information about your personal data processing, please see our Recruitment Privacy Policy</strong></p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
