    "id": "himalayas-768cee4b83f5",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "Full Stack PHP Developer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "United States",
    "description": "<h3>This is a remote position.</h3><div>\n<div>\n<b>ROLE HIGHLIGHTS</b><ul>\n<li>PHP 60K-80K Monthly</li>\n<li>Fun working environment and culture</li>\n<li>Work From Home</li>\n<li>Fixed Day Shift schedule, with flexible start time (as long as within 6-7 AM)</li>\n<li>5-day work week - Weekends Off</li>\n<li>HMO package with dependent/s</li>\n<li>Full-time, regular employment</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div>\n<b>YOUR ROLE</b><div>TRG’s software arm eSkilled, is a leading Software as a Service (SaaS) provider, with offices in Australia and the Philippines. We are looking for an experienced Full Stack PHP Developer to join our dynamic team. <div>You will be responsible for effective feature development of a custom-built PHP SASS system to deliver company and client visions.<div>You will demonstrate a high level of experience and talent as a full stack developer, with a proven track record.<div>\n<b>YOUR RESPONSIBILITIES:</b><ul>\n<li>You will be working remotely in an Agile environment alongside tight knit teams in Brisbane, Australia and Manila, Philippines.</li>\n<li>You will be part of a fast-growing company with great career opportunities and skill development.</li>\n<li>You will experience working with an international Development Manager and other highly skilled developers.</li>\n<li>You will assume the duties of a PHP Developer that include Full Stack feature development and maintenance, among other responsibilities, assisted by the project manager and senior developers.</li>\n<li>You will be able to work autonomously and as part of talented team.</li>\n<li>You will have great attention to detail, pride in your work, a desire to learn new skills and strive to exceed in your role.</li>\n</ul>\n<div><div>\n<b>You must possess:</b><ul>\n<li>At least Bachelor's/College Degree in Computer Science/Information Technology or equivalent.</li>\n<li>At least 3+ years development experience</li>\n<li>Strong Level PHP/HTML/CSS/Javascript</li>\n<li>Working to and understanding of best practices for code structure and commenting/documenting</li>\n<li>Strong Level SQL skills</li>\n<li>Experience developing and working with APIs / web services and integrations</li>\n<li>Ability to effectively prioritise concurrent tasks along with the scope and desired outcome of a project</li>\n<li>Analytical, debugging, and troubleshooting skills</li>\n<li>Willingness to learn and master new technologies</li>\n</ul>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h3>BIG ADVANTAGE IF YOU ALSO HAVE</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Best practice systems design and architecture</li>\n<li>Requirements Analysis experience to understand the needs of small-scale features for stakeholders, to translate into requirements.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>WHAT'S IN IT FOR YOU?</h3>\n</div>\n<ul>\n<li>Permanent work-from-home</li>\n<li>6 AM – 7 AM shift start time</li>\n<li>No night shifts &amp; weekend work</li>\n<li>Fast career growth &amp; development with our internal promotion</li>\n<li>PHP 100,000 medical coverage for 2 dependents</li>\n<li>Dental and optical benefits</li>\n<li>Company-provided equipment</li>\n<li>Virtual games, events, and lunch outs</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
