    "title": "PHP Developer - Work From Home",
    "company": "",
    "location": "India",
    "description": "<p>Our client a Canadian software development company is looking for PHP developer to join their already established team in India. The Developer will support their end customers with sophisticated cloud-based applications and dashboards.</p><p>The work is <strong>fully remote</strong> from the comfort of your home and following India Schedule MON-FRI 9:00 – 18:00. You need to have the infrastructure to support work from home like laptop, internet and UPS.</p><p>An attractive package is provided to those candidates with the skills provided below and with the necessary team spirit and personal character that enjoys the challenges of high-quality development and support.<br><br><strong>Requirements:</strong></p><ul>\n<li>1 to 3 years as PHP developer</li>\n<li>Solid knowledge of the following is MANDATORY:</li>\n</ul><h3>-          HTML and CSS</h3><h3>-          AJAX</h3><h3>-          PHP</h3><h3>-          JavaScript</h3><h3>-          jQuery</h3><h3>-          Bootstrap</h3><h3>-          MySQL</h3><ul>\n<li class=\"\">Developing Web User Interfaces (mandatory)</li>\n<li class=\"\">Minimum 6 months experience with Yii2 framework. (mandatory)</li>\n<li class=\"\">Experience in:</li>\n</ul><p>-          Building flexible &amp; easy to maintain responsive websites</p><p>-          Database queries, performance tuning, triggers etc. MySQL, MSSQL</p><h3>-          GIT or other Version Control</h3><h3>-          JQuery Plugins</h3><p>-          Data analytics and AmChart development a plus.</p><ul>\n<li class=\"\">C++ and C# knowledge are a plus</li>\n<li class=\"\">Experience in Flutter App is a plus</li>\n<li class=\"\">Knowledge of Server Management, maintaining Web Server, deploying applications, Settings up cron Jobs etc. (Desired, but not mandatory)</li>\n<li class=\"\">Proactive and team oriented professional.</li>\n<li class=\"\">Excellent time management skills</li>\n<li class=\"\">Effective communication skills</li>\n<li class=\"\">Excellent Command of English</li>\n</ul><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
