    "id": "himalayas-604524890899",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "PHP Developer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "South Africa",
    "description": "<h3>PHP Developer (Backend Focus)</h3><p>As a <strong>PHP Developer</strong>, you will be responsible for developing and maintaining backend web applications for an international team. This role is heavily focused on backend development, while also supporting API integrations, database management, and occasional front-end development.</p><p>You will help build scalable, reliable applications and contribute to the ongoing improvement of existing systems and platforms.</p><h3>What's In It for You</h3><ul>\n<li>Fully remote role</li>\n<li>Full-time position (US hours) ﻿3pm -12pm SA time</li>\n<li>Opportunity to collaborate with international teams</li>\n<li>Supportive and innovative work environment</li>\n<li>Long-term career growth opportunities</li>\n</ul><h3>What You Will Be Doing</h3><ul>\n<li>Develop and maintain backend web applications using PHP</li>\n<li>Build, maintain, and optimize APIs</li>\n<li>Write and optimize SQL queries and database structures</li>\n<li>Troubleshoot, maintain, and improve existing applications</li>\n<li>Support front-end development when required</li>\n<li>Participate in application architecture and technical discussions</li>\n<li>Collaborate with team members to deliver robust software solutions</li>\n</ul><h3>Qualifications</h3><ul>\n<li>4+ years of professional PHP development experience</li>\n<li>Experience with Laravel, Symfony, or similar PHP frameworks</li>\n<li>Strong SQL and database management experience</li>\n<li>Experience with REST APIs and Git</li>\n<li>Basic knowledge of HTML, CSS, and JavaScript</li>\n<li>Strong analytical and problem-solving skills</li>\n<li>Ability to work independently in a remote environment</li>\n</ul><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
