  {
    "id": "himalayas-e55b26ea8d37",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "React Native Developer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "South Africa",
    "description": "<p>Our client is on a mission to revolutionize restaurant bookings, and need passionate developers to help them build the best mobile experience. As a <strong>React Native Developer</strong>, you’ll be at the heart of their product, crafting seamless and high-performance applications for both iOS and Android.</p><p>Join their dynamic team and collaborate with product managers, designers, and backend engineers to create intuitive and feature-rich mobile apps that delight users. If you thrive in a fast-paced environment and love solving real-world problems, we’d love to hear from you!</p><h3><strong>What You’ll Do:</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>Lead the design, development, and continuous improvement of mobile apps using React Native.</li>\n<li>Work closely with product managers and designers to bring innovative ideas to life.</li>\n<li>Build and maintain reusable, scalable components and libraries.</li>\n<li>Optimize app performance for smooth animations, efficient resource usage, and fast load times.</li>\n<li>Integrate seamlessly with APIs, third-party services, and native modules like Apple Pay and Google Maps.</li>\n<li>Contribute to technical discussions, advocating best practices in mobile development.</li>\n<li>Identify and solve user experience and development challenges proactively.</li>\n</ul><h3>Requirements</h3><ul>\n<li>Strong experience with <strong>React Native</strong> and <strong>JavaScript/TypeScript</strong>.</li>\n<li>Proven track record of building and maintaining mobile applications on <strong>both iOS and Android</strong>.</li>\n<li>Expertise with <strong>React Navigation, Expo, or other navigation libraries</strong>.</li>\n<li>A keen eye for <strong>performance optimization</strong> and debugging.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with <strong>CI/CD pipelines</strong> for mobile app deployment.</li>\n<li>A user-first mindset, with a passion for delivering impactful features.</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>Bonus Points If You Have:</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>Experience with <strong>video and map integrations</strong>.</li>\n<li>Knowledge of <strong>analytics and A/B testing</strong> for mobile apps.</li>\n<li>Background in <strong>marketplace or booking system applications</strong>.</li>\n</ul><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
