  {
    "id": "himalayas-c3db26d8e2d8",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "Freelance React Native Developer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "Australia, Canada, India, United Kingdom, United States",
    "description": "<p><strong><a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/flying-bisons\">Flying Bisons</a></strong> is a <strong>leading Digital Consulting &amp; Delivery company</strong> based in the heart of Europe, Warsaw. Our mission is to help our clients to Unleash Digital Potential™. We discover, define, design, and develop world-class digital products that drive business results for our clients, shaping digital experiences for millions of people around the world.<br><br>We stand out due to our end-to-end process that allows us to approach each and every challenge with confidence that we can deliver the best results. Our expertise includes Research, Digital Strategy, Branding, Content (Written, Photos, Videos), Product Design, Web &amp; Mobile Development, Data Analytics &amp; AI.</p><p>Join our 120-people team to co-create industry-defining products and heart-racing experiences for the biggest brands (Mercedes AMG, IKEA, KFC, eObuwie, Żabka, Sanofi, Zain) and disruptive startups (like Booksy, Nethone, Telemedi, or DevSkiller)!</p><p>We're building a curated <strong>network of talented freelance</strong><strong>React Native Developers</strong> that we can call upon for existing and future projects. When you apply to join our <strong>freelancer base</strong>, you will be evaluated and kept on file. You may not be contacted immediately. When a project matches your specific expertise, you’ll be invited to participate and can choose to accept or decline based on your availability. If you're interested in becoming part of our talent pool, please <strong>submit your CV</strong>. We’ll get in touch as soon as an opportunity aligned with your skills arises.</p><p><strong>Are you self-driven, and dependable professional?</strong> If so, we look forward to hearing from you!</p><h3>Contract type: B2B</h3><h3>What skills and experience do we expect?</h3><ul>\n<li><p><strong>3+ years of commercial experience in React Native</strong> development (experience with the latest versions is a plus)</p></li>\n<li><p>Knowledge of <strong>TypeScript</strong> and strong skills in <strong>JavaScript ES6+</strong></p></li>\n<li><p>Familiarity with <strong>Xcode</strong> and <strong>Android Studio</strong></p></li>\n<li><p>Experience with <strong>Expo</strong> and its ecosystem</p></li>\n<li><p>Experience with <strong>deployment</strong> applications on the <strong>Google Play Store</strong> and the <strong>Apple App Store</strong></p></li>\n<li><p>Familiarity with <strong>Git</strong> version control system</p></li>\n<li><p>Proficiency in <strong>React Hooks </strong>and the ability to effectively use functional components</p></li>\n<li><p>Experience in working with <strong>REST APIs</strong> and hands-on experience with React Query or other data-fetching libraries</p></li>\n<li><p>Experience with <strong>state management libraries</strong> such as Redux (Toolkit), Recoil, Zustand, or MobX</p></li>\n<li><h3>Good command of English (B2+) and Polish</h3></li>\n<li><p>Willingness to learn and develop by implementing challenging and ambitious projects</p></li>\n</ul><ul>\n<li><p>Experience with creating animations using <strong>Reanimated</strong></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Experience with building forms using React Hook Form</strong></p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Proficiency in navigation management using React Navigation or Expo Router</strong></p></li>\n<li><p>Experience in writing<strong> automated tests</strong></p></li>\n<li><p>Understanding of <strong>WCAG</strong><strong>standards</strong> and ability to implement accessibility guidelines in mobile apps</p></li>\n<li><p>Familiarity with <strong>Storybook</strong> and experience in building and managing <strong>Design Systems</strong></p></li>\n<li><p>Experience with <strong>native modules</strong> (Objective-C, Swift, Kotlin, or Java) for extending React Native capabilities</p></li>\n<li><p class=\"p1\">Knowledge and <strong>experience in working with AI</strong></p></li>\n</ul><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
