    "title": "React JS (UI Developer) | Remote | 4 to 9 years (B2 or B1 level)",
    "company": "",
    "location": "United States",
    "description": "<h3><strong>Job Title:</strong></h3><h3>React JS (UI Developer)</h3><h3><strong>Experience Required:</strong></h3><h3>4 to 9 years (B2 or B1 level)</h3><h3><strong>Location:</strong></h3><p>Any Brillio office location (for Full-Time Employees) / Remote (for Contract Workers)</p><h3><strong>Engagement Model:</strong></h3><p>Time &amp; Material (T&amp;M)  Fixed Price (FP) model to be finalized</p><h3><strong>Shift Timings:</strong></h3><p>General Shift  May require occasional calls outside working hours as per project needs (standard 8-hour workday)</p><h3><strong>Job Summary:</strong></h3><p>Brillio is seeking skilled and passionate <strong>React JS UI Developers</strong> to join our team. The ideal candidate should have hands-on experience in React JS along with strong proficiency in HTML and CSS. This is a great opportunity to work on impactful projects, collaborate with cross-functional teams, and grow in a fast-paced environment.</p><h3><strong>Primary Skills (Must Have):</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><h3>React JS (UI Development)</h3></li>\n<li><h3>HTML</h3></li>\n<li><h3>CSS</h3></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>Secondary Skills (Good to Have):</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Advanced React concepts (Hooks, Context API, Code Splitting, etc.)</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Scope of Work:</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><p>Develop and maintain responsive web applications using React JS.</p></li>\n<li><p>Write clean, maintainable, and efficient code using HTML and CSS.</p></li>\n<li><p>Collaborate with UX designers, backend developers, and QA teams to deliver quality software.</p></li>\n<li><p>Participate in code reviews and contribute to team best practices.</p></li>\n<li><p>Debug and resolve technical issues across different browsers and devices.</p></li>\n<li><p>Optimize components for maximum performance across a vast array of web-capable devices and browsers.</p></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>Role of Resource:</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Developer / Lead Developer depending on experience and capability</p></li></ul><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
