  {
    "id": "himalayas-4ca717b3fcde",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "JavaScript/React Native Developer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "India",
    "description": "<h3>Accelerate your career with PradeepIT</h3><p>PradeepIT is one of the largest, globally recognized IT Consulting firm to connect India's deeply vetted talent team to global customer.</p><p>Were headquartered in Bengaluru, Silicon Valley of India. PradeepITs customers include SAP Lab, Bosch, Rolls-Royce, Daikin, Daimler and J&amp;J and hundreds of other Fortune 500 companies and fast-growing startups.</p><p>With continuous hard work and working remotely by choice, PradeepIT is certified as a Great Place to Work! Trusted by leading brands and fortune 500 companies from around the world, we have achieved:</p><h3>6+ Years of Experience</h3><h3>580+ Open source technology Consultant</h3><h3>120+ SAP Consultant</h3><h3>40+ Salesforce Consultant</h3><h3>60+ Adobe Consultant</h3><h3>100+ Mobility Consultant</h3><h3>890+ Clients in APAC, EMEA &amp; USA</h3><h3>Our Beliefs</h3><p>PradeepIT believes in connecting people across the globe and provide them an opportunity work on remotely. Being a people-first organization, PradeepIT constantly strives for individuals who won't just keep up, but break new ground, work with cutting edge technology and ramp-up their skills with course created by our Vertical Heads, Senior Architect for freely with help of PradeepIT Academy.</p><h3>Job Responsibilities:</h3><ul>\n<li>Develop new features for the application</li>\n<li>Lead QA efforts and perform other assigned duties</li>\n<li>Test app performance, usability, and hardware/software compatibility</li>\n<li>Participate and lead in the release processes</li>\n<li>Document/prioritize bugs and requested features as required</li>\n<li>Help guide the product roadmap, design, and architecture</li>\n</ul><h3>Job Requirements:</h3><ul>\n<li>Bachelors/Masters degree in Engineering, Computer Science (or equivalent experience)</li>\n<li>At least 3+ years of relevant experience as a software developer</li>\n<li>Demonstrated React experience (React Native is a huge plus)</li>\n<li>Strong knowledge and experience with React, JavaScript, HTML5 &amp; CSS</li>\n<li>Experience with back-end resources such as AWS and Heroku</li>\n<li>Experience using Git/GitHub with high levels of version control knowledge</li>\n<li>Designing and/or implementing APIs for mobile and desktop applications</li>\n<li>Good understanding of how an app should flow</li>\n<li>Ability to recognize bottlenecks and errors in current code</li>\n<li>Experience working within rapid development cycles and tight schedules</li>\n<li>Impeccable attention to detail on every line of code, unit test, and commit messages</li>\n<li>Track record of shipping applications to both the Apple and Google Play Stores</li>\n<li>Familiarity with PostgreSQL, Node, Flowtype, xCode, Swift, Android Studio, Eclipse, and SaaS is an added advantage</li>\n</ul><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
