  {
    "id": "himalayas-caceacfae386",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "Senior .NET / React Web Developer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "United States",
    "description": "<p>Join a team of experienced professionals to develop effective web solutions for clients ranging from Silicon Valley start-ups to Chicago private equity firms to Nashville healthcare companies to leading local St. Louis firms.</p><p>Integrity's developers partner with user experience designers and content strategists to solve challenging problems for our clients by designing/developing world-class web-based solutions - including custom web applications, iOS mobile apps and Android mobile apps.</p><h3>Core requirements include:</h3><ul>\n<li>C#/MVC</li>\n<li>REST APIs</li>\n<li>React / Next.js</li>\n<li>MS SQL</li>\n<li>Passion for quality code</li>\n<li>Excellent problem solver and strategic thinker with strong soft skills</li>\n</ul><p>At Integrity, we hire for <strong>character and soft skills</strong> because we believe in growing talent from within. However, the ideal candidate will have prior experience with the following:</p><ul>\n<li>\n<h3>Technical Skills:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>3+ years of experience with <strong>.NET C#</strong>, including developing Web APIs with AJAX and RESTful services.</li>\n<li>Experience with <strong>React / Next.js</strong>\n</li>\n<li>Proficiency in repository management using <strong>Git</strong>.</li>\n<li>Strong knowledge of object-oriented programming principles.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with writing unit tests to ensure code quality.</li>\n<li>Understanding of Agile software development methodologies and practices.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<h3>Soft Skills:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Exceptional <strong>verbal and written communication skills</strong> to collaborate with team members and stakeholders effectively.</li>\n<li>A passion for working in a highly collaborative environment that values teamwork.</li>\n<li>A growth mindset with the desire and ability to learn daily and adapt to new challenges.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><p>Must have a passion for all things web, learning every day and working with the most creative, technical, awesome team.</p><p>Excellent opportunity for a senior .NET / React web developer to join the leading web design, development and consulting firm headquartered in the historic Tivoli Theatre off the Loop neighborhood in amazing St. Louis - with a flexible work from anywhere environment.</p><p>We are looking for creative professionals who want to learn on a daily basis, take pride in developing highly usable, intuitive web/mobile solutions and hope to change the world via technology.</p><h3>We hire people based upon the H's:</h3><ul>\n<li>Happy - a zest for life and desire to delight our clients</li>\n<li>Humble - no egos allowed. ever.</li>\n<li>Hungry - will want to change the world</li>\n<li>Honest - always do what you say you're gonna do</li>\n</ul><p><strong>NO offshore firms, applicants or recruiters, please. </strong></p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
