    "description": "<p>Supervisory-level web development work overseeing web specialists creating, programming, testing, and documenting a website and web applications. An employee in this class is responsible for supervising assigned projects for the development and maintenance of the website. Working with staff in order to plan and implement assigned web development responsibilities is a significant aspect of the work. The employee is responsible for training, assigning project and permanent system responsibilities, and reviewing the work products of subordinates. Work is performed under the direction of a technical superior.</p><p>languages such as PHP, Python, Java, or Ruby on Rails, along with databases like MySQL or PostgreSQL.</p><p>All your information will be kept confidential according to EEO guidelines.</p><h3>softwaregpt</h3><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
