  {
    "id": "himalayas-fae8c35f01fe",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "Web Developer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "Philippines",
    "description": "<p>This role is only open for candidates that are legally allowed to work within the Philippines</p><p>We are seeking a skilled Web Developer with strong WordPress expertise to develop, maintain, and optimize websites. The ideal candidate will have experience building custom WordPress solutions and a passion for creating responsive, user-friendly web experiences. Experience with application development, AI integrations, and media/advertising platforms is highly desirable.</p><h3>Responsibilities</h3><ul>\n<li>Develop, customize, and maintain WordPress websites and web applications.</li>\n<li>Create custom themes, plugins, and website functionality.</li>\n<li>Optimize website performance, security, and user experience.</li>\n<li>Troubleshoot and resolve website issues in a timely manner.</li>\n<li>Implement responsive designs across desktop and mobile devices.</li>\n<li>Collaborate with designers, content teams, and stakeholders on project requirements.</li>\n<li>Integrate third-party tools, APIs, and marketing technologies.</li>\n<li>Support website enhancements and ongoing maintenance.</li>\n<li>Assist with application development and AI integrations when required.</li>\n</ul><h3>Requirements &amp; Qualifications:</h3><ul>\n<li>Proven experience as a Web Developer with strong WordPress expertise.</li>\n<li>Proficiency in HTML, CSS, JavaScript, PHP, and WordPress development.</li>\n<li>Experience with website troubleshooting, optimization, and maintenance.</li>\n<li>Understanding of responsive web design principles.</li>\n<li>Strong problem-solving and analytical skills.</li>\n<li>Excellent communication and collaboration abilities.</li>\n</ul><h3>Preferred Qualifications:</h3><ul>\n<li>Experience in application development.</li>\n<li>Experience integrating AI tools, APIs, or automation solutions.</li>\n<li>Knowledge of media, publishing, advertising, or digital marketing industries.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with SEO best practices and website analytics.</li>\n<li>Experience with hosting environments, version control systems, and website security best practices.</li>\n</ul><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
