    "id": "himalayas-17192f7809f1",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "Web Developer -Remote or Singapore",
    "company": "",
    "location": "Singapore",
    "description": "Category: Technology <br><br>Location: Remote or Singapore Remote or Singapore Remote or Singapore <br><br><br><div>\n<b>About Us:</b><br>\n</div><p><a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/wiselywise\">WiselyWise</a>is a leading Global EdTech Startup from Singapore. At <a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/wiselywise\">WiselyWise</a>, our Vision is to enable a better Digital Future for Everyone. We are committed to Solving the Twin Challenges of Employment &amp; Employability by enabling Students’ Transformation through Digital Skills Enablement starting with Artificial Intelligence (AI).</p><p>Our Flagship productWiseCentral - a Cloud based Online AI Education Platform, has an unmatched Success Record across some of the Best Universities, Corporates, Educational Institutions, K-12 Schools globally.</p><h3>Salient features of our Platform:</h3><div>·Cost-Effective, Easy to Use Platform<br>\n</div><div>·Learning Paths with multiple Skill Oriented Courses derived from Our team’s Real-World Experience<br>\n</div><div>·Multiple Teaching modes – Online, Classroom, Flipped, Bootcamp, Workshops<br>\n</div><div>·In line with the global Curriculums of leading Universities with proven Learning Methods<br>\n</div><p>Our Mission is to continue Investing in our Platform to create new Value-Adds for Students in the Long Run.</p><h3>If you were wondering about Results?</h3><p>Changing Careers, Getting Jobs, Starting new Ventures, Winning Google Hackathons, Using their AI projects for successful application to Higher Studies in Global Universities – Our Student Alumni have done it all.</p><p>Visit our website at:</p><p>We are looking for experienced and talented web developers to join our remote team, and help develop complex Wordpress websites for the business. Our Web Developers will support our business and work closely with customers globally.</p><p></p><p>As a Web Developer, your role would involve:</p><p></p><ul>\n<li><p>Development skills on WordPress, such as WordPress theme development, PHP, Javascript, HTML and CSS.</p></li>\n<li><h3>Working on Elegant Themes and Plugins</h3></li>\n<li><h3>Divi Builder</h3></li>\n<li><p>Customisations and integrations to other applications on WordPress</p></li>\n<li><p>Design high standards of Project Delivery and deadlines to be applied to all our projects</p></li>\n<li><p>Engage with the clients on technical specifications for the projects</p></li>\n</ul><h3>Requirements:</h3><ul>\n<li><p>Minimum 4-5 years experience in developing complex Wordpress websites</p></li>\n<li><p>Solid experience in having worked on world-class Themes and Plugins</p></li>\n<li><p>Experience in installing and configuring WordPress plugins</p></li>\n<li><p>Experience in integrations of Plugins to other applications</p></li>\n<li><p>Excellent communication skills both verbal and written</p></li>\n<li><p>Must have experience working and collaborating with a remote team</p></li>\n<li><p>Must be a Team player, enthusiastic, and motivated</p></li>\n</ul><p></p><h3>Nice to have:</h3><ul><li><p>Having an eye for design and detail, and the ability to create beautiful websites would be a plus</p></li></ul><div>Educational Qualification:</div><div>Relevant Degree</div><br><br><br><br>Details<p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
