    "title": "Drupal Web Developer / Designer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "United States",
    "description": "<h3>This is a remote position.</h3><h3>About the Role</h3><p>This is an opportunity for a freelance, skilled Drupal web developer/designer . The developer will restructure the website, implement design improvements, and handle ongoing maintenance and security updates. The ideal candidate will be comfortable working in both technical development and design adjustments, with the ability to manage content in Arabic.</p><p>The project will start as soon as possible with initial restructuring and design changes (project-based), followed by ongoing maintenance and updates (monthly).</p><div>\n<h3>Responsibilities<ul>\n<li><p>Website Restructuring: Redesign site architecture, menus, and navigation for improved usability; optimize content structure.</p></li>\n<li><p>Design Adjustments: Update layouts, color schemes, and typography as needed; implement responsive design for mobile and desktop.</p></li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n</h3>\n<h3>Requirements</h3>\n<li><p>Proven experience with <b>Drupal development</b> (themes, modules, site building) and designing appealing and navigation-friendly websites.</p></li>\n<li><p>Strong understanding of Drupal security practices.</p></li>\n<li><h3>Basic design/UX skills.</h3></li>\n<li><p>Experience with multilingual websites <b>(Arabic required)</b>.</p></li>\n<li><p>Ability to work independently and provide regular updates.</p></li>\n<li><p>Familiarity with <b>NGOs best practices.</b></p></li>\n<br><h3>Benefits</h3>\n<li><p>Competitive freelance compensation (project-based and ongoing maintenance).</p></li>\n<li><h3>Flexible, remote work setup.</h3></li>\n<li><p>Opportunity to work on meaningful projects with impact in the MENA region.</p></li>\n<li><p>Gain experience in both web development and design adjustments.</p></li>\n<br>\n</div><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
