    "title": "Web Developer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "United States",
    "description": "<h3>This is a remote position.</h3><div>We are looking for a proactive web developer who will manage our website routine. Essential responsibilities will include launching new websites, updating and improving existing websites. You should be able to understand the latest web trends and constantly seek an opportunity to innovate. We have a variety of websites across our projects, such as blogs, e-commerce, of simple one-pagers.<br><h3>Requirements</h3>\n<div>We believe in equal opportunity and the ability to learn. We do not require you to have a specific degree, but skillset and previous experience are beneficial for this position.<ul>\n<li>Web development skills confirmed with previous experience</li>\n<li>Knowledge of the modern platforms (WP, Woo, Shopify, Prestashop, etc...)</li>\n<li>Understanding of multichannel sales experience (IG, FB, Pinterest, Amazon, eBay, etc)</li>\n<li>Ability to work under deadlines and perform within KPIs</li>\n<li>Fluent in English (other languages are beneficial)</li>\n</ul>\n<br><h3>Benefits</h3>\n<p>We are always trying to make sure there is room for growth. It doesn't matter how big you start, and the sky is the limit.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multicultural creative team</li>\n<li>Flexible working hours</li>\n<li>Ability to work remotely</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n</div>\n</div><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
