  {
    "id": "himalayas-b1ff117e2772",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "Frontend Developer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "United States",
    "description": "<h3>This is a remote position.</h3><div>A dynamic digital agency is looking for an experienced Frontend Developer with a strong proficiency in JavaScript and Vue.js to join their team. You will work on developing and maintaining charity websites and other digital products. This role requires clean coding practices, confidence in your skills, and the ability to work collaboratively with their international team.<div>\n<b>RESPONSIBILITIES:</b><li>Develop and maintain frontend features for charity websites and other products.</li>\n<li>Write clean, efficient, and well-documented code.</li>\n<li>Collaborate with a diverse team of developers based in Pakistan, Ukraine, and Poland.</li>\n<li>Participate in code reviews and provide constructive feedback.</li>\n<li>Ensure high performance and responsiveness of applications.</li>\n<li>Troubleshoot and debug issues as they arise.<br><h3>Requirements</h3>\n<div></div>\n</li>\n<li>Strong proficiency in JavaScript and Vue.js.</li>\n<li>Proven experience in frontend development.</li>\n<li>Ability to write clean and maintainable code.</li>\n<li>Experience working with RESTful APIs.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with version control systems (e.g., Git).</li>\n<li>Excellent problem-solving skills and attention to detail.</li>\n<li>Ability to work independently and as part of a team.</li>\n<li>Good communication skills in English.</li>\n</div>\n<li>Familiarity with other modern frontend frameworks and libraries.</li>\n<li>Understanding of backend development concepts.<br><h3>Benefits</h3>\n</li>\n<li>Work on meaningful projects that make a difference.</li>\n<li>Join a supportive and diverse international team.</li>\n<li>Opportunities for professional growth and development.<br>\n</li>\n</div><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
