    "location": "Italy",
    "description": "<p>Designing and implementing FIGMA designs for desktop and mobile</p><p>Adding new backend features using PHP programming language</p><p>Writing clean, efficient code to enhance application functionality.</p><p>Debugging and troubleshooting issues in web applications.</p><p>Collaborating with other team members to enhance application functionality.</p><h3>- 2-3 years of experience</h3><ul>\n<li>⁠Frontend is a most and backend is a plus</li>\n</ul><h3>- ⁠Experience in PHP is a must</h3><ul>\n<li>⁠Experience in ecommerce / marketplaces is a plus</li>\n</ul><h3>- ⁠Fluent in English</h3><p>All your information will be kept confidential according to EEO guidelines.</p><p>We are a startup that’s a rental marketplace (think of it as the Amazon for rentals where we connect rental shops of consumer goods (gopros, DJ controllers, camping tents, board games…) with end-users. </p><p>We already purchased a white-label solution so we have a website in place. The main responsibilities would be to develop Figma designs that are completed to rebrand the website, handle the mobile responsiveness, suggest / implement new features, etc.</p><ul>\n<li>Requirements are:*</li>\n</ul><h3>- 2-3 years of experience</h3><ul>\n<li>⁠Frontend is a most and backend is a plus<br>- ⁠Experience in PHP is a must<br>- ⁠Experience in ecommerce / marketplaces is a plus</li>\n</ul><h3>- ⁠Fluent in English</h3><p>Start date: ASAP</p><h3>Salary range: 1,000-1,300USD. </h3><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
