    "company": "",
    "location": "India",
    "description": "<p><strong>Exciting Opportunity Alert: Join the BuildBear Team!</strong></p><p>Are you a TypeScript expert with skills in NextJS and RemixJS? We're looking for an experienced Web Development Engineer to lead our Frontend Web Development Team, creating top-notch, efficient, and testable code.</p><p><strong>Your Star Performance: Expectations and Responsibilities</strong></p><h3>Typescript:</h3><ul>\n<li>Showcase your extensive TypeScript experience.</li>\n<li>Your code follows guidelines and is designed for maintainability.</li>\n</ul><h3>NextJS:</h3><ul>\n<li>Your NextJS proficiency is top-tier.</li>\n<li>Bonus if you have experience with RemixJS.</li>\n</ul><h3>CSS/Styling:</h3><ul>\n<li>Demonstrate your styling skills with captivating CSS techniques.</li>\n<li>Craft visually stunning and responsive user interfaces.</li>\n</ul><h3>UI/UX Matters:</h3><ul>\n<li>Embrace the principles of UI/UX, creating a frontend experience that turns heads.</li>\n<li>Your track record reflects delivering user-centric solutions.</li>\n</ul><h3>Scaling:</h3><ul>\n<li>Navigate the intricacies of scaling frontend microservices.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with AWS services is a plus.</li>\n</ul><h3>Team Leadership:</h3><ul><li>Guide the team to excellence with proven leadership skills.</li></ul><h3>Startup Experience:</h3><ul>\n<li>Bring adaptability and hands-on experience from the startup world.</li>\n<li>Thrive in our fast-paced, collaborative startup environment.</li>\n</ul><h3>Requirements: Bringing the Star Power</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Must Have:</strong><ul><li>At least 5 years of experience in frontend development.</li></ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Good to Have:</strong><ul><li>A degree in Software Engineering, Information Technology, or a related field.</li></ul>\n</li>\n</ul><h3>About BuildBear: Join the Innovation</h3><p>At BuildBear, we're crafting the first seamless CI/CD infrastructure for Smart Contracts and Web3 Applications. Founded by visionaries Dipesh and Emmanuel, our project is backed by marquee investors, and our passionate, distributed team is pushing the boundaries of Web3 Applications.</p><h3>Why Work for BuildBear: Be Part of Something Big</h3><p>Joining BuildBear isn't just a job; it's an opportunity to be part of a dynamic and innovative team that's reshaping the future. Contribute your ideas, make a real impact, and witness your efforts shape the direction of our company.</p><h3>Perks of the Gig: The Grand Finale</h3><p>Early joiners are in for a treat with stock options, aligning your success with the rise of BuildBear. Be a key player in our growth story and enjoy the benefits of being an early and integral part of our innovative team.</p><p><strong>Join the Team at BuildBear: Lets Make Innovation Together!</strong></p><p>Apply now and be a key player in our growth story, enjoying the benefits of being an early and integral part of our innovative team. BuildBear  where we're not just building a product; we're crafting a vision and pushing boundaries. Let the journey begin! </p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
