  {
    "id": "himalayas-87ff5a390e87",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "Frontend Software Engineer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "Remote",
    "description": "<p><strong>Role Title: </strong>Frontend Software Engineer</p><p><strong>Role Type: </strong>Contractor</p><p><strong>Location: </strong>Remote</p><p><a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1\">micro1</a> is engaging experienced Frontend Software Engineers for a specialized AI training project. This is not a traditional software engineering role. Instead of building production applications, you'll leverage your frontend expertise to create high-quality technical documentation, examples, and structured outputs that help train and improve next-generation AI systems.</p><p>No previous AI experience is required. Your frontend engineering knowledge is what matters.</p><p>Leverage your ability to interpret detailed component style guides and screenshots, delivering pixel-accurate, responsive web interfaces that set new standards in usability and aesthetics. Strong communication skills are highly valued for effective collaboration and documentation.</p><h3>Scope of Work</h3><ol>\n<li>Create high-quality technical documentation and structured examples based on real-world frontend engineering scenarios.</li>\n<li>Apply your frontend engineering expertise to evaluate UI implementations, styling decisions, and best practices.</li>\n<li>Interpret component style guides and screenshots to produce accurate technical outputs and documentation.</li>\n<li>Interpret and translate component style guides and interface screenshots into precise, visually consistent UI deliverables.</li>\n<li>Implement pixel-perfect, responsive web components using modern technologies such as Typescript and CSS3.</li>\n<li>Ensure all UI elements adhere to established design systems and accessibility standards.</li>\n<li>Collaborate asynchronously through clear documentation and constructive feedback within a remote-first environment.</li>\n<li>Proactively identify, communicate, and resolve inconsistencies or ambiguities in design specifications.</li>\n<li>Optimize UI performance across devices, focusing on fast load times and smooth interactions.</li>\n<li>Contribute domain-specific expertise to guide the training and development of advanced AI models.</li>\n</ol><h3>Preferred Qualifications</h3><ol>\n<li>Minimum of 3 years of professional experience delivering high-quality front-end solutions.</li>\n<li>Proven proficiency with Typescript, CSS3, and responsive web design principles.</li>\n<li>Demonstrated success in building pixel-perfect interfaces from detailed visual references.</li>\n<li>Experience working with and extending component style guides and design systems.</li>\n<li>Strong English communication skills</li>\n<li>Self-motivated and capable of delivering autonomously within distributed project environments.</li>\n<li>Advanced degree (Master’s or PhD) in Computer Science or a related technical discipline is a plus.</li>\n</ol><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
