    "id": "himalayas-2f14d693487f",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "Senior Front End Developer - JavaScript",
    "company": "",
    "location": "Malaysia",
    "description": "<p>The client is a leading Game Development company in the Asia market. We opt to deliver innovative products and immersive gaming experiences to the player worldwide. We are looking for a Senior Frontend Developer to develop and maintain a cross-browser web application, including new games.</p><h3>Responsibilities:</h3><ul>\n<li> Collaborating with the Team Lead and other stakeholders to develop Gaming products.</li>\n<li> Maintaining and implementing new features/ enhancements to existing products.</li>\n<li> Communicating closely with frontend and backend teams, as well as UI/UX designers, to ensure the development activities align with the project goals</li>\n</ul><h3>Requirement:</h3><ul>\n<li> 5 years or more of experience in web application development</li>\n<li> Strong coding skills in Typescript, Javascript, HTML5, CSS.</li>\n<li> Strong critical thinking skills and problem-solving skills.</li>\n<li> Experience with WebSocket and binary communication protocols.</li>\n<li> Experience with Egret is a plus.</li>\n<li> Experience with Gaming products is a plus.</li>\n<li> Able to read and write Chinese language is an added advantage. </li>\n<li>Willing to work on EMEA timezone as you will be supporting the Europe Market. </li>\n</ul><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
