  {
    "id": "himalayas-42fb6435b2a6",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "Frontend Developer (React)",
    "company": "",
    "location": "United States",
    "description": "<h3>Job Title:</h3><h3>Senior Frontend Engineer – React</h3><p><strong>Location:</strong> Remote – Latin America </p><p><strong>Type of Contract:</strong> Full-Time | Remote</p><p><strong>Salary Range:</strong> Market Rates</p><p><strong>Language Requirements:</strong> Professional English (written and verbal)</p><p>Our client is seeking a skilled <strong>Senior Frontend Engineer with strong React experience</strong> to join their growing engineering team. You will play a key role in building high-quality frontend applications while serving as a technical liaison between offshore and onshore engineering teams. Your work will directly impact development quality, team alignment, and the successful delivery of scalable software solutions.</p><h3>Key Responsibilities</h3><ul>\n<li>Design, develop, and maintain modern, scalable frontend applications using React and related technologies.</li>\n<li>Serve as a technical bridge between onshore and offshore engineering teams, ensuring clear communication of requirements, technical decisions, priorities, and project expectations.</li>\n<li>Collaborate with product managers, designers, backend engineers, and other stakeholders to translate business requirements into effective frontend solutions.</li>\n<li>Provide technical guidance and support to offshore developers, helping resolve complex implementation challenges and maintain consistent engineering standards.</li>\n<li>Participate in architecture discussions, code reviews, technical planning, and development best practices.</li>\n<li>Troubleshoot and optimize frontend applications for performance, scalability, usability, and reliability.</li>\n<li>Proactively identify technical risks, communicate blockers, and help coordinate solutions across distributed teams.</li>\n</ul><h3>Must-Have Qualifications</h3><ul>\n<li>5+ years of professional frontend development experience with strong expertise in <strong>React</strong>.</li>\n<li>proficiency in JavaScript and/or TypeScript, HTML, and CSS.</li>\n<li>Proven experience building and maintaining production-grade web applications.</li>\n<li>Experience working with distributed, offshore, or cross-functional engineering teams.</li>\n<li>Strong communication skills with the ability to effectively translate technical concepts between engineering teams and business stakeholders.</li>\n<li>Demonstrated ability to operate at a senior level, take ownership of technical decisions, and provide guidance to other developers.</li>\n<li>Experience with Git, code reviews, testing practices, and modern frontend development workflows.</li>\n</ul><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
