  {
    "id": "himalayas-7a7ed860de70",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "Full Stack Developer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "China",
    "description": "<h3>Full Stack Developer</h3><h3>Location: Hong Kong</h3><p>Employment Type: Full-Time</p><h3>Industry: Blockchain / Gaming / Web3</h3><h3><strong>About the Role</strong></h3><p>We're looking for a skilled and passionate Full Stack Developer to join our growing team and help build cutting-edge blockchain-powered gaming experiences. This role combines both front-end and back-end development, smart contract integration, and collaboration with creative teams to bring interactive Web3 games to life.</p><p>You'll work in a fast-moving, multicultural environment where your technical expertise and love for gaming will directly contribute to innovative product launches.</p><h3><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>﻿</strong>Build and maintain full-stack game features including smart contract interactions and user interfaces</li>\n<li><p>Develop backend systems, APIs, and databases to support game mechanics and data</p></li>\n<li><p>Design responsive and engaging front-end experiences using modern frameworks</p></li>\n<li><p>Integrate blockchain technologies (e.g., Ethereum, NFTs, ERC standards) into game logic</p></li>\n<li><p>Collaborate with designers, artists, and other developers for cohesive gameplay</p></li>\n<li><p>Write clean, efficient, and scalable code</p></li>\n<li><p>Conduct testing and debugging to ensure platform stability</p></li>\n<li><p>Stay updated with blockchain and gaming trends, tools, and technologies</p></li>\n<li>Work cross-functionally with QA, product managers, and stakeholders to meet development goals</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>Requirements</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><p>Bachelor's or Master's degree in Computer Science or related field</p></li>\n<li><p>Proven experience as a Full Stack Developer, preferably in gaming or blockchain projects</p></li>\n<li><p>Strong knowledge of JavaScript, Python, or Solidity</p></li>\n<li><p>Experience with React, Vue, or other modern front-end frameworks</p></li>\n<li><p>Familiarity with backend frameworks like Node.js, Express, Django, etc.</p></li>\n<li><p>Hands-on experience with smart contract development and blockchain APIs</p></li>\n<li><p>Solid problem-solving skills and attention to detail</p></li>\n<li><p>Good communication and teamwork in a distributed work environment</p></li>\n<li><p>Passion for games and an understanding of game development pipelines</p></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>Perks &amp; Benefits</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><p> Work with a diverse and international team</p></li>\n<li><h3>Token and NFT incentive programs</h3></li>\n<li><h3> Flat, collaborative structure</h3></li>\n<li><h3> Casual work culture</h3></li>\n<li><p> Opportunities to work across various Web3 gaming brands</p></li>\n<li><p> Competitive medical, life, and transport benefits</p></li>\n</ul><p><strong>Ready to build the future of blockchain gaming? Apply now and be part of a company redefining play in Web3.</strong></p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
