    "location": "Poland, Saudi Arabia",
    "description": "We are seeking a Mid Web Full-Stack Developer to join our product engineering team and help shape the next generation of our web applications. In this role you will own features end to end, from concept and design to implementation, testing, deployment, and ongoing optimization. You will collaborate closely with product managers, designers, and QA, translating user needs into reliable software that delivers real business impact and a polished user experience. This is a hands-on, collaborative position in a fast-paced, inclusive environment where curiosity and quality are valued as highly as velocity.<a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/jobs-for-humanity\">Jobs for Humanity</a> is collaborating with Rimthan to build an inclusive and just employment ecosystem. We support individuals coming from all walks of life. <br><br> Company Name: Rimthan<br><br><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
