  {
    "id": "himalayas-a3bf3e013829",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "Full Stack Developer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "United States",
    "description": "<p><strong>Full Stack Developer (Remote)</strong><br><br><strong>Location:</strong> Remote<br><strong>Employment Type:</strong> Full-Time</p><p><strong>Are you a Full Stack Developer ready to take on challenging and rewarding projects?</strong><br>Were seeking a talented developer for a fully <strong>remote position</strong>, open to <strong>all nationalities</strong>. If you excel in both front-end and back-end development and thrive in a dynamic environment, we want to hear from you!</p><h3><strong>Key Responsibilities:</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>Build and maintain dynamic web applications using <strong>React.js/Next.js</strong> on the front-end and <strong>Node.js/Express.js</strong> on the back-end.</li>\n<li>Design and manage databases, particularly <strong>PostgreSQL</strong>, ensuring scalability and reliability.</li>\n<li>Implement <strong>Redux</strong> for efficient state management across applications.</li>\n<li>Utilize <strong>Docker</strong> and container orchestration tools to streamline deployments and manage applications efficiently.</li>\n<li>Collaborate with cross-functional teams to develop new features and ensure seamless integration.</li>\n<li>Debug and troubleshoot complex issues to maintain application performance.</li>\n<li>Stay up-to-date with modern web development tools, frameworks, and best practices.</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>Qualifications:</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>Proficiency in <strong>React.js/Next.js</strong> and <strong>Node.js/Express.js</strong> frameworks.</li>\n<li>Strong experience with <strong>PostgreSQL</strong> and database design principles.</li>\n<li>Knowledge of <strong>Redux</strong> for effective state management.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with <strong>Docker</strong> and container orchestration tools (e.g., Kubernetes experience is a bonus).</li>\n<li>Excellent problem-solving skills with a detail-oriented approach.</li>\n<li>Ability to work independently in a fully remote setup.</li>\n<li>Strong communication skills in English.</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>What We Offer:</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>A <strong>fully remote</strong> role with flexible working hours.</li>\n<li>Collaboration with a global, diverse, and innovative team.</li>\n<li>Opportunities for career growth and professional development.</li>\n<li>Competitive salary and benefits package.</li>\n</ul><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
