    "title": "Full Stack Developer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "South Africa",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/remote-recruitment\">Remote Recruitment</a> is hiring a <strong>Full Stack Developer</strong> for our UK-based clients. This is a fully remote position offering South African professionals an excellent opportunity to work with leading UK employers from home. You will work UK business hours and join a supportive, fast-growing team.</p><h3>Key Responsibilities</h3><ul>\n<li>Design, build and maintain scalable web applications using modern frontend and backend technologies</li>\n<li>Collaborate with product managers and designers to translate requirements into robust technical solutions</li>\n<li>Write clean, testable code and conduct thorough code reviews</li>\n<li>Integrate third-party APIs and services into existing platforms</li>\n<li>Troubleshoot and debug production issues, ensuring high availability</li>\n</ul><h3>Requirements</h3><ul>\n<li>3+ years of full stack development experience</li>\n<li>Proficiency in React or Vue.js on the frontend and Node.js or Python on the backend</li>\n<li>Strong understanding of RESTful APIs and database design (SQL and NoSQL)</li>\n<li>Experience with cloud platforms (AWS, GCP or Azure)</li>\n<li>Familiarity with CI/CD pipelines and version control (Git)</li>\n</ul><h3>What We Offer</h3><ul>\n<li>R42,000/month</li>\n<li>100% remote, UK business hours</li>\n<li>Career growth and professional development</li>\n<li>Exposure to leading UK businesses and practices</li>\n</ul><p><em><a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/remote-recruitment\">Remote Recruitment</a> – connecting top South African talent with UK employers. Apply today.</em></p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
