ternal and external users improve productivity.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Prototyping</strong>: Rapidly prototype new product ideas and features, then refine the most promising ones into production-ready systems.</li>\n</ul><h4><strong>4. Collaboration &amp; Experimentation</strong></h4><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Leadership Collaboration</strong>: Partner with leadership to identify opportunities where AI and software can create leverage and deliver value.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Tool and Model Experimentation</strong>: Stay on the cutting edge by experimenting with new AI models, tools, and frameworks.</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>What Were Looking For:</strong></h3><h4><strong>Required Skills &amp; Traits:</strong></h4><ul>\n<li>Strong experience as a Full Stack Developer.</li>\n<li>Experience with modern frontend tools like React, Next.js, TypeScript, or similar.</li>\n<li>Strong backend experience using Node.js, Python, APIs, databases, and scalable system design.</li>\n<li>Proficiency with Claude Code for building, debugging, and optimizing software.</li>\n<li>A genuine obsession with AI, emerging tools, and the future of software development.</li>\n<li>Strong communication skills with the ability to work effectively in a fast-moving team.</li>\n<li>Ability to move quickly, take ownership, and solve complex problems with minimal direction.</li>\n</ul><h4><strong>Nice to Have:</strong></h4><ul>\n<li>Experience with OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, or open-source models.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with building agent frameworks, RAG, vector databases, or tool-calling systems.</li>\n<li>Experience building internal platforms, analytics systems, or automation tools.</li>\n<li>Startup or high-performance agency experience.</li>\n<li>Experience shipping software quickly while maintaining high engineering standards.</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>Why This Role Is Different:</strong></h3><p>This is not a maintenance role. Its not for someone comfortable with slow-moving corporate environments or traditional development. This role is for someone who wants to help shape the future of an ambitious, AI-first company and play a key part in developing the products that come out of it. Youll have room to experiment, push ideas forward, and help define how AI truly integrates into a business with real momentum.</p><h3><strong>Application Process:</strong></h3><ol>\n<li>\n<strong>Submit Your Application</strong>: Send your resume and a brief cover letter detailing your relevant experience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Assessment</strong>: If shortlisted, complete an assessment to showcase your technical skills and ability to think strategically.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Interview</strong>: Candidates will go through 1-2 rounds of interviews to evaluate your full-stack development expertise, AI fluency, and problem-solving approach.</li>\n</ol><h3>Ready to Shape the Future? Apply Now!</h3><p>We are an equal opportunity employer and celebrate diversity in our workforce.</p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
