    "company": "",
    "location": "United States",
    "description": "<div class=\"content-intro\"><p><a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/orion-innovation\">Orion Innovation</a> is a premier, award-winning, global business and technology services firm.  Orion delivers game-changing business transformation and product development rooted in digital strategy, experience design, and engineering, with a unique combination of agility, scale, and maturity.  We work with a wide range of clients across many industries including financial services, professional services, telecommunications and media, consumer products, automotive, industrial automation, professional sports and entertainment, life sciences, ecommerce, and education.</p></div><p>We are seeking a highly experienced Senior Full Stack .NET Developers. This role involves leveraging expertise in C#, .NET, Angular, and cloud technologies like Azure to deliver innovative solutions that align with business goals. The focus is on ensuring seamless project execution while maintaining high-quality standards.</p><h3>Key Responsibilities:</h3><ul>\n<li>Lead the design, development, and implementation of full-stack applications using .NET and Angular.</li>\n<li>Collaborate with cross-functional teams to gather and analyze requirements, ensuring technical feasibility.</li>\n<li>Ensure the security, performance, and scalability of applications deployed on Azure cloud solutions.</li>\n<li>Implement best practices for code versioning and collaboration using Git.</li>\n<li>Manage databases effectively with SQL Server to support application development efforts.</li>\n<li>Provide technical guidance and mentorship to team members, fostering a culture of excellence.</li>\n<li>Stay updated on emerging technologies to enhance team capabilities and project outcomes.</li>\n</ul><p><strong>Required Skills and Experience:</strong><br><strong>Mandatory:</strong></p><ul>\n<li>Proficiency in C# and .NET framework.</li>\n<li>Strong expertise in Angular for frontend development.</li>\n<li>Solid experience with Azure cloud services.</li>\n<li>Hands-on knowledge of Git for version control.</li>\n<li>Experience with SQL Server for database management.</li>\n<li>Minimum 8 years of overall development experience in relevant technologies.</li>\n</ul><div class=\"content-conclusion\">\n<p>Orion is an equal opportunity employer, and all qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, creed, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, pregnancy, age, national origin, citizenship status, disability status, genetic information, protected veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by law.</p>\n<h3>Candidate Privacy Policy</h3>\n<p>Orion Systems Integrators, LLC and its subsidiaries and its affiliates (collectively, “Orion,” “we” or “us”) are committed to protecting your privacy. This Candidate Privacy Policy (orioninc.com) (“Notice”) explains:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>What information we collect during our application and recruitment process and why we collect it;</li>\n<li>How we handle that information; and</li>\n<li>How to access and update that information.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Your use of Orion services is governed by any applicable terms in this notice and our general Privacy Policy.</p>\n</div><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
