  {
    "id": "himalayas-3f4d4ff7cbe5",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "Full Stack Developer (Nestjs/Angular)",
    "company": "",
    "location": "United States",
    "description": "Category: Computer <br><br>Location: <br><br><br><div>We are seeking an experienced Full Stack Developer to join our dynamic tech team at Univacity. As a Full Stack Developer, you will play a crucial role in developing and maintaining our platform using cutting-edge technologies.<br>\n</div><div>\n<b>Responsibilities:</b><ul>\n<li>Collaborate with cross-functional teams to design, develop, and implement high-quality web applications.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Develop server-side logic using NestJS, MongoDB/Mongoose, and TypeScript.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Design and implement front-end components using Angular for a seamless user experience.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Create and maintain APIs to ensure efficient data flow between the front-end and back-end systems.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Debug, troubleshoot, and optimize application performance for smooth and responsive user interactions.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Work on feature enhancements, bug fixes, and contribute to the entire development lifecycle.<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<br><h3>Requirements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Proven experience as a Full Stack Developer with expertise in NestJS, Angular, MongoDB/Mongoose, and TypeScript.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Strong understanding of RESTful APIs, web services, and microservices architecture.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Proficiency in front-end development including HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Familiarity with version control systems (e.g., Git) and agile development methodologies.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Excellent problem-solving skills and ability to work in a fast-paced, collaborative environment.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Bachelor's degree in Computer Science or related field (preferred).<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div>Join our innovative team and contribute to building a platform that empowers students worldwide to achieve their educational dreams. If you're passionate about full stack development and creating impactful solutions, we'd love to hear from you!<br>\n</div>\n<br><br><br><br>Details</div><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
