    "id": "himalayas-f431fac21cf1",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "Application Security Engineer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "Indonesia",
    "description": "<h3>Application Security Engineer</h3><p><strong>Job Title:</strong> Application Security Engineer<br><strong>Location:</strong> Remote, Indonesia<br><strong>Job Type:</strong> Full-Time<br><strong>Experience Required:</strong> 4 to 7 years<br><strong>Eligibility:</strong> Male/Female both can apply</p><h3>Role Description</h3><p>We are hiring an Application Security Engineer to help embed security into the software development lifecycle and improve the security posture of applications before they reach production. In this role, you will review application design, support secure coding practices, assess technical risks, and work with developers to identify and remediate vulnerabilities. You will help create a culture where security is built into engineering processes from the beginning. This role is ideal for someone who understands software systems well and enjoys combining security thinking with practical engineering collaboration.</p><h3>Key Responsibilities</h3><ul>\n<li>Review application designs for security risks</li>\n<li>Support secure coding practices and developer guidance</li>\n<li>Identify vulnerabilities and recommend remediation actions</li>\n<li>Work with engineering teams on security improvements</li>\n<li>Assist with testing, scanning, and review processes</li>\n<li>Maintain security standards and documentation</li>\n<li>Support secure delivery across the development lifecycle</li>\n</ul><h3>Required Skills</h3><ul>\n<li>Application security</li>\n<li>Secure development practices</li>\n<li>Vulnerability assessment</li>\n<li>Risk analysis</li>\n<li>Engineering collaboration</li>\n<li>Documentation</li>\n<li>Security mindset</li>\n<li>Problem solving</li>\n</ul><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
