    "id": "himalayas-02f0eb33f260",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "Senior 2D JavaScript Game Developer-6+ years",
    "company": "",
    "location": "India",
    "description": "<p><strong>Position: </strong><strong>Senior 2D JavaScript Game Developer</strong></p><h3>Remote: Yes</h3><h3>Start Date: Immediate</h3><h3>Duration: 3 months extendable</h3><h3>Number of positions: 2</h3><h3>Experience: 4+ Years</h3><h3>Working shift timing: India shift</h3><p>Selection Process: Technical Round followed by Practice Round. </p><h3>Job Description: Please find below</h3><ul>\n<li> Highly skilled and experienced Senior 2D JavaScript Game Developer</li>\n<li> Passionate about game development and has a strong background in mathematics for collision detection and velocity physics.</li>\n<li>As a Senior JavaScript Game Developer, you will be responsible for developing interactive and engaging games using J<strong>avaScript, HTML5, and CSS3</strong>. </li>\n</ul><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Responsibilities:</strong> Develop interactive and engaging games using <strong>JavaScript, HTML5, and CSS3</strong>.</li>\n<li> Implement mathematics algorithms for collision detection and physics simulations.</li>\n<li> Collaborate with artists, designers, and other developers to create game mechanics and features.</li>\n<li> Optimize game performance for different platforms and devices.</li>\n<li> Conduct code reviews and provide feedback to junior developers.</li>\n<li> Research and implement emerging game development technologies and techniques.</li>\n<li>Stay up-to-date with industry trends and best practices.</li>\n<li>Experience integrating game environments with back-end systems and APIs (nice-to-have)</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Requirements: </strong><strong>Bachelor of Science in Computer Science</strong> or related field.</li>\n<li>Relevant coursework in <strong>Mathematics for Game Developers and Physics for Game </strong>Developers.</li>\n<li> Proficiency in <strong>JavaScript, HTML5, and CSS3, Phaser and CreateJS - MUST HAVE</strong><br>Strong understanding of game development principles and best practices.</li>\n<li> Excellent mathematics skills for game development, including collision detection algorithms, physics simulations for velocity and motion, vector and matrix operations, and trigonometry and calculus for game mechanics.</li>\n<li>Experience with game engines/frameworks such as Phaser, CreateJS, or similar Good understanding of <strong>CSS3</strong> and JS Animation frameworks like <strong>Greenshok / AnimJS</strong> to support 2D game development -<strong> GOOD TO HAVE </strong>Knowledge of software engineering principles and design patterns.</li>\n<li> Familiarity with version control systems (e.g., Git) and collaborative development workflows.</li>\n<li>Strong problem-solving and debugging skills.</li>\n<li>Effective communication and collaboration within multidisciplinary teams.</li>\n</ul><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Experience:</strong><br>Minimum of <strong>4 years</strong> of experience as a JavaScript Game Developer or similar role.</li>\n<li>Demonstrated experience in developing interactive games using <strong>JavaScript, HTML5, and CSS3.</strong>\n</li>\n<li>Experience implementing mathematics algorithms for collision detection and physics simulations.</li>\n<li>Strong portfolio showcasing previous game development projects.</li>\n</ul><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
