    "title": "🚀 Moodle Plugin Developer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "Germany",
    "description": "<p>Are you passionate about development and ready to work on exciting projects in the e-learning sphere? Do you excel at creating powerful and user-friendly tools for educational platforms? If yes, then this opportunity is for you! 💼</p><h3><strong>What Will You Be Doing?</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><p>Designing and maintaining Moodle plugins to enhance the e-learning experience.</p></li>\n<li><p>Utilizing cutting-edge AI technologies to improve functionality and user satisfaction.</p></li>\n<li><p>Integrating new features aligned with international educational standards.</p></li>\n<li><p>Contributing to discussions and enhancing the quality of our products.</p></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>What Do We Offer?</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><p><strong>Full-time employment</strong> for candidates residing in Germany, or a <strong>freelance, project-based contract</strong> for those outside the country.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Remote work</strong> with a flexible schedule—you choose when and where to work.</p></li>\n<li><p>Competitive pay and bonuses for successful releases.</p></li>\n<li><p>Opportunities for professional growth and involvement in unique projects.</p></li>\n<li><p>A collaborative, supportive, and professional team that values quality and results.</p></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>How to Apply?</strong></h3><p>Send your resume, GitHub/portfolio link, and examples of your Moodle plugins to us.</p><p>Join us and help shape the future of online education today! 🌟</p><h3>Requirements</h3><h3>We’re seeking a talented developer who:</h3><ul>\n<li><p><strong>Has experience developing plugins for LMS Moodle</strong>, including successfully publishing them on .</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Writes clean and maintainable code</strong>, strictly following the Moodle Coding Style—this is a must.</p></li>\n<li><p>Is familiar with modern AI tools such as OpenAI, Gemini API, Cline, Aider, and others. Experience in this area is a strong plus.</p></li>\n</ul><h3>Highlights</h3><p>Designing and maintaining LMS Moodle plugins.</p><h3>Utilizing cutting-edge AI technologies.</h3><p>Integrating new features aligned with international educational standards.</p><h3>Enhancing the quality of our products.</h3><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
