    "company": "",
    "location": "United States",
    "description": "<h3>This is a remote position.</h3><pre><b>Job Role:</b><div>We are seeking a highly skilled WordPress Plugin API Developer to join our team. The successful candidate will be responsible for developing and maintaining our custom plugin that integrate with our API. The candidate must have strong experience in WordPress development, API integration, and plugin development.<div>As a part of your role, you will be required to work on our plugin, which connects WordPress websites with mobile apps that are built on our proprietary platform. You will be responsible for API integrations as our plugin acts as a bridge between our platform, our customers' WordPress websites and their apps.<div>\n<br><b>Project Role:</b>WordPress Plugin &amp; API Developer</div>\n<div>\n<b>Work Experience:</b> 3+ years<div>\n<b>Work location:</b>Remote<div>\n<b>Must Have Skills:</b>WordPress, WooCommerce &amp; API Integration<div>\n<b>Role and Responsibilities</b><ul>\n<li>Maintaining and updating our existingWordPress plugin.</li>\n<li>Releasing monthly updates of our plugin.</li>\n<li>Integrate our plugin with other popular plugins and third party services.</li>\n<li>Debugging and troubleshooting plugin issues.</li>\n<li>Creating and documenting plugin APIs.</li>\n<li>Developing and integrating APIs, including REST and Social APIs, into WordPress.</li>\n<li>Experience with WooCommerce development.</li>\n<li>Payment gateway development experience.</li>\n<li>Collaborating with the development team to ensure seamless integration with existing systems.</li>\n<li>Staying up-to-date with the latest WordPress trends and best practices.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><b>Technical Profile</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Expertise in WordPress Plugin &amp; API development</li>\n<li>Strong knowledge of PHP &amp; Laravel</li>\n<li>Working Knowledge with Web Services - SOAP, REST</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Desired Candidate Profile</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Good communication skills</li>\n<li>Good, positive attitude</li>\n<li>Good debugging and problem-solving skills</li>\n<li>Good IQ</li>\n<li>Lots of common sense</li>\n</ul>\n<br>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></pre><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
