    "title": "IT Website Developer",
    "company": "",
    "location": "United States",
    "description": "Category: Marketing <br><br>Location: <br><br><br><div>\n<b>Please note: We are not actively hiring for this position at the moment, but we are accepting applications for future openings.</b><div>The IT Website Developer is a strategic position that plays a pivotal role in the data integrity of key <a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/my-amazon-guy\">My Amazon Guy</a> functions. It is responsible for creating and maintaining high-quality, user-friendly websites in accordance with MAG standards. Possess advanced analytical and decision-making skills. An ability to be an expert in problem-solving, critical thinking and an understanding of complex system dependencies are essential in enabling the IT Manager to show where <a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/my-amazon-guy\">My Amazon Guy</a> processes are broken and how those processes are affecting key data points.<br>\n</div>\n<div>An individual with a strong passion to solve problems and improve data integrity will excel in this position.<br>\n</div>\n<div>\n<b>About <a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/my-amazon-guy\">My Amazon Guy</a></b><br>\n</div>\n<div>\n<a href=\"https://himalayas.app/companies/my-amazon-guy\">My Amazon Guy</a> is a thriving digital marketing agency with over 500+ employees and a diverse range of clients. Our culture is dynamic, rewarding, and innovative. We are dedicated to helping our clients achieve remarkable sales growth on Amazon while ensuring their peace of mind.<br>\n</div>\n<div>\n<b>Key Responsibilities</b><ul>\n<li>Design, develop, and maintain company websites to ensure optimal performance, functionality, and user experience<br>\n</li>\n<li>Create and update website pages in WordPress, keeping layouts consistent and visually appealing.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Manage plugins, including installation, updates, and removals, to maintain site security and stability.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Conduct regular audits to identify and resolve website issues such as broken links and performance errors<br>\n</li>\n<li>Collaborate with design, marketing, and IT teams to implement new features and integrations.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Monitor website uptime, speed, and mobile responsiveness, addressing issues promptly.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Perform website backups, security checks, and general maintenance to ensure data safety.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Manage tasks and deadlines using Asana or similar tools to meet project timelines.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Stay updated on web technologies and apply best practices to improve site functionality<br>\n</li>\n<li>Support IT and marketing teams with troubleshooting, integrations, and other technical needs.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Maintain company standards for website branding, compliance, and overall site health.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Adapt to evolving business needs and assist in projects that contribute to company growth.<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<br><h3>Requirements</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Proven web designs in WordPress<br>\n</li>\n<li>Experience in web hosting, WordPress security, plugin development, website speed, and core vitals.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Upkeep the website and take necessary changes to keep it functional, healthy, and continuously build the pages<br>\n</li>\n<li>Knowledgeable in creating graphic designs and have an eye for well-designed and laid-out pages.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Knowledgeable in plugin maintenance and able to install, update, or retire plugins as needed.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Have the ability to communicate well and work well with people from various parts of the company and from different cultures.<br>\n</li>\n<li>Have an eye for well-designed and laid-out pages.<br>\n</li>\n<li>A dual Monitor setup is required (at least 8GB of RAM)<br>\n</li>\n<li>Must have at least 25 MBPS internet speed<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<br><h3>Benefits</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>40 hours a week, 8 hours a day<br>\n</li>\n<li>Competitive salary base<br>\n</li>\n<li>Permanent WFH setup<br>\n</li>\n<li>Unlimited FREE access to MAG School courses and SOP Library!<br>\n</li>\n<li>Work schedule is in EST (Monday-Friday only)<br>\n</li>\n<li>Opportunities for professional development and career advancement<br><br><br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<br><br><br><br>Details</div>\n</div><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
