    "company": "",
    "location": "India",
    "description": "<p>**Join Our Team as a Senior Dynamics Developer!**</p><p>Are you an experienced Dynamics Developer with a passion for innovation? ITHR 360 Consulting is seeking a talented individual with a minimum of 5-8 years of experience in Dynamics development to join our team on a remote WFH engagement basis.</p><h3>**Role:** Dynamics Developer  </h3><h3>**Experience:** Minimum 5-8 Years  </h3><p>**Engagement Type:** Remote WFH Engagement  </p><h3>**Salary:** Indian Market Standard  </h3><p>**Availability to Join:** Within 15 Days  </p><h3>**Responsibilities:**</h3><ul>\n<li>Develop custom .NET components, including WCF web services, dialog-based workflows, and plugins, while integrating custom web pages into CRM.</li>\n<li>Interact with MS CRM database using web service methods.</li>\n<li>Design, build, and modify existing business-tier components, Web applications, and database objects using Microsoft platform technologies such as Web API, REST API using .NET, and Azure.</li>\n<li>Develop MS Dynamics 365 cloud applications based on business requirements.</li>\n<li>Ensure the security of APIs by implementing proper authentication mechanisms, encryption, and data privacy measures.</li>\n<li>Customize entities, sitemap, and write client-side JavaScript for complex applications on the Microsoft Dynamics 365 CRM platform.</li>\n</ul><h3>**Requirements:**</h3><ul>\n<li>Extensive experience in Dynamics 365 development with a focus on customization, integration, and web services.</li>\n<li>Proficiency in developing custom .NET components, including WCF web services, dialog-based workflows, and plugins.</li>\n<li>Strong understanding of Microsoft platform technologies such as Web API, REST API using .NET, and Azure.</li>\n<li>Experience with CRM database interaction using web service methods.</li>\n<li>Excellent problem-solving skills and attention to detail.</li>\n<li>Ability to work independently and as part of a collaborative team.</li>\n<li>Relevant experience of at least 10+ years preferred.</li>\n</ul><p>If you're ready to take your Dynamics development skills to the next level and work with a collaborative team in a remote environment, we want to hear from you! Apply now by sending your resume to .</p><h3>*About ITHR 360 Consulting:*  </h3><p>ITHR 360 Consulting is a leading provider of IT consulting services, specializing in Dynamics solutions. We are committed to delivering high-quality services to our clients while providing a supportive and inclusive work environment for our team members. Join us and be part of our journey in shaping the future of Dynamics development!</p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
