  {
    "id": "himalayas-9a2e5d8e8ed1",
    "source": "Himalayas",
    "title": "Dynamics CRM Developer | Remote | Brillio",
    "company": "",
    "location": "United States",
    "description": "<h3>Dynamics CRM Developer | Remote | Brillio</h3><p>We have a requirement for <strong>Dynamic CRM</strong> from Lalatendu (Brillio). Please check the details below:</p><p><strong>Description:</strong> Dynamics CRM + Azure + C## + Dotnet + Power Apps</p><p><strong>Number of Positions:</strong> 01</p><p><strong>Work Location:</strong> Remote</p><p><strong>Experience Range:</strong> 6-7 years</p><p><strong>Project Duration:</strong> 6 months <br>﻿</p><h3>﻿</h3><h3>Job Description: Dynamics CRM Developer</h3><p><strong>Company:</strong> Brillio<br><strong>Job Title:</strong> Dynamics CRM Developer<br><strong>Location:</strong> Remote<br><strong>Project Duration:</strong> 6 months<br><strong>Number of Positions:</strong> 1</p><h4><strong>Role Overview:</strong></h4><p>We are seeking a skilled Dynamics CRM Developer with 6-7 years of experience to join our team. The ideal candidate will have hands-on expertise in Dynamics CRM, Azure, C#, .NET, and Power Apps, with a proven ability to design, develop, and deliver high-quality solutions for enterprise-level projects.</p><h4><strong>Key Responsibilities:</strong></h4><ul>\n<li>Develop and customize Dynamics CRM solutions to meet business requirements.</li>\n<li>Design and implement workflows, plugins, and customizations within Dynamics CRM.</li>\n<li>Integrate Dynamics CRM with Azure services and third-party applications.</li>\n<li>Develop and maintain applications using C# and .NET frameworks.</li>\n<li>Utilize Power Apps to build business applications and extend Dynamics CRM functionality.</li>\n<li>Collaborate with cross-functional teams to gather requirements, design solutions, and deliver project milestones.</li>\n<li>Provide technical support and resolve issues for Dynamics CRM implementations.</li>\n<li>Ensure solutions are scalable, secure, and adhere to best practices.</li>\n</ul><h4><strong>Skills and Qualifications:</strong></h4><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Technical Skills:</strong><ul>\n<li>Proficient in Dynamics CRM (customization, configuration, workflows, and plugins).</li>\n<li>Experience with Azure services and their integration with Dynamics CRM.</li>\n<li>Strong programming skills in C# and .NET frameworks.</li>\n<li>Expertise in Power Apps for application development.</li>\n<li>Familiarity with REST APIs and data integration techniques.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Experience:</strong><ul>\n<li>6-7 years of professional experience in Dynamics CRM development.</li>\n<li>Proven track record of delivering CRM projects successfully.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Other Skills:</strong><ul>\n<li>Strong problem-solving skills and attention to detail.</li>\n<li>Excellent communication and collaboration abilities.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>",
